<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JHN" style="id">- Sankaran</book>
  <para style="h">Yuhana</para>
  <para style="toc2">YUH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yuhana</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuhana</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JHN 1"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ye Kuma le ri mɛn bɔni Alla rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 1:1"/>A damira, Kuma tɛrɛ ye. Kuma ni Alla tɛrɛ ye i ɲɔɔn fɛ. Kuma wo ye Alla le ri. <verse eid="JHN 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 1:2"/>Kɛbi fɔlɔfɔlɔ Kuma ni Alla ye i ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 1:3"/>Alla ka fen bɛɛ dan Kuma de la. Fen bɛɛ mɛn danda, a ma foyi dan Kuma kɔ ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 1:4"/>Ale le ɲenemaya ri. Ɲenemaya ye kɛnɛbɔlan de ri adamaden bɛɛ ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 1:5"/>Kɛnɛbɔlan bɔra dibi rɔ, kɔni dibi wo ma se a ma.<verse eid="JHN 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 1:6"/>Alla ka cɛɛ kelen nana mɛn tɔɔ ko <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔɔ ye a fɔla Yuhana mɛn ma ko Yaya.</char></note>Yuhana mɛn ye mɔɔ sunna ji rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 1:7"/>A nara ka kɛ sere ri, ka kɛnɛbɔlan wo ko fɔ mɔɔilu yɛ, sa mɔɔilu bɛɛ ri lemɛniya kɛnɛbɔlan wo ma a la kumailu sababu la. <verse eid="JHN 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 1:8"/>A tɛrɛ tɛ kɛnɛbɔlan wo ri, kɔni a nara kɛnɛbɔlan wo sereyala.<verse eid="JHN 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 1:9"/>Kɛnɛ wo tɛrɛ ye kɛnɛbɔlan bɛrɛ bɛrɛ le ri, mɛn ye kɛnɛ bɔla adamaden bɛɛ yɛ. Ale nani tɛrɛ dunuɲa rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 1:10"/>Nba, Kuma wo tɛrɛ ye dunuɲa rɔ. Alla ka dunuɲa dan Kuma wo le la, kɔni dunuɲa ma a lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 1:11"/>Kuma wo nara a la jama le kanma, kɔni a la jamana mɔɔilu ma ii sɔn wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 1:12"/>Kɔni mɔɔ mɛnilu sɔnda a ma, mɛnilu kɔnin lemɛniyara a ma, a ka se di woilu bɛɛ ma ka kɛ Alla denilu ri. <verse eid="JHN 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 1:13"/>Ii ma kɛ Alla denilu ri ikomin muso ye den sɔrɔnna ɲa mɛn ma. Ii ma kɛ Alla denilu ri ka a masɔrɔn cɛɛ do ye a fɛ a muso ye den sɔrɔn, wala ka a masɔrɔn muso lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye cɛɛ do la, wala cɛɛ lɔɔ tɛrɛ ye muso do la. Alla jɛrɛ le ka ii kɛ a denilu ri.<verse eid="JHN 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 1:14"/>Nba, Kuma wo kɛra adamaden di ka na i sii an tɛma. An ka a la nɔɔrɔ yen, Dencɛ kelen mɛn kelen pe bɔni Fa Alla rɔ. Nɔɔrɔ wo le a kan, a ni ɲumaya ba a ni tuɲa. <verse eid="JHN 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 1:15"/>Nba, Yaya ka sereya bɔ a la ko rɔ ka a kan nabɔ ko: «N kan tɛrɛ ye mɛn ma ko: ‹Mɛn natɔ n kɔ, ale le ɲin di. A ka bon n di, ka a masɔrɔn a tɛrɛ ye ye ka a tɛrɛn n ma sɔrɔn fɔlɔ.›» <verse eid="JHN 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 1:16"/>Nba, an bɛɛ ra do sɔrɔn a la ɲumaya ba rɔ. Baa a ra ɲumaya kɛ an yɛ, ka do la a kan tuma bɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 1:17"/>Alla ka sariya mɛn di an ma, ka fara Nabi Musa la, kɔni a ka a ɲumaya ba a ni a tuɲa di an ma ka fara Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin na. <verse eid="JHN 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 1:18"/>Mɔɔ si ma Alla yen a ɲa la fɔlɔ habadan, kɔni mɛn kelen pe bɔni Alla rɔ, wo mɛn fanan ye Alla ri, ale le ka an nalɔnniya Alla la ko la. A ye Fa Alla tɔrɔfɛ tuma bɛɛ.<verse eid="JHN 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya mɛn ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mɔɔ mɛnilu ye sunna ji rɔ: wo kɔrɔ ye le ko ii ra lemɛniya Alla ma Isa tɔɔ rɔ.</char></note>a la sereya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 1:19"/>Nba, Yahudiya la kuntii mɛn ye Jerusalɛmu, woilu ka ii la sarakalaselailu a ni Lebi bɔnsɔnilu lawa, tuma mɛn na, ko ii ye Yaya maɲininka ko: «Yon de ile ri?» Yaya la sereya le ɲin di. <verse eid="JHN 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 1:20"/>Yaya ma a sɔsɔ, kɔni a ka a fɔ ka a gbɛ ii yɛ ka ii jabi: «Nde tɛ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di.» <verse eid="JHN 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 1:21"/>Wo rɔ, ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Nba, a kɛnin di? I ye Nabi Eli le ri wa?» A ka a fɔ ko: «Nde tɛ Nabi Eli ri.» Ii ka a maɲininka ikɔ tuunni ko: «Alla la nabi mɛn ko fɔni, ile le wo ri wa?» A ka a fɔ ko: «Ɛɛn de.» <verse eid="JHN 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 1:22"/>Wo rɔ ii ka a fɔ ko: «Yon de i ri? An ye wa jabili kelen don mɔɔilu bolo mɛnilu ka an nana i ma. I ye nfen fɔla i jɛrɛ la ko rɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 1:23"/>Yaya ka ii jabi: «N ye mɔɔkan, mɛn ye bɔla wula kɔndɔ ko: ‹Ai ye sila latelen, Maari ri taama mɛn kan.› Ikomin Nabi Esayi kumara ɲa mɛn kitabu kɔndɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 1:24"/>Mɔɔilu mɛn ka ii kelaya woilu tɛrɛ ye Farisilu le ri. <verse eid="JHN 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 1:25"/>Wo ka ɲininkali kelen di a ma: «I ko i tɛ Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. Nabi Eli tɛ i ri. I tɛ nabi fanan di mɛn ko fɔni. Wo rɔ, nfenna i ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 1:26"/>Yaya ka ii jabi: «Nde ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ. Kɔni mɔɔ do ye ai tɛma yan ai ma a lɔn, <verse eid="JHN 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 1:27"/>wo natɔ n kɔ ma, hali ka a la sanbara julu fulɛn ka a bɔ a sen dɔ, wo ka bon nde ma.» <verse eid="JHN 1:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 1:28"/>Ko wo bɛɛ taminda Betani so kɔndɔ a ni Juridɛn Ba telebɔ rɔ, Yaya tɛrɛ ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.<verse eid="JHN 1:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ye Alla Dencɛ le ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 1:29"/>Lon wo taminnin, Yaya ka Isa natɔla yen, tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ɲa lɔ! Alla la Saa bulan de, mɛn ye julumun bɔla dunuɲa ma. <verse eid="JHN 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 1:30"/>N tɛrɛ ye kumala ɲin de la ko rɔ. N ka a fɔ ai yɛ ko: ‹Mɛn natɔ n kɔ, ale le ɲin di. A ka bon n di, ka a masɔrɔn a tɛrɛ ye ye ka a tɛrɛn n ma sɔrɔn fɔlɔ› <verse eid="JHN 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 1:31"/>Nde ma a lɔn, kɔni nde nani ka na mɔɔilu sun ji rɔ kosa a ri yiraka Isirayɛlikailu la.»<verse eid="JHN 1:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 1:32"/>Nba, Yaya ka sereya bɔ ko: «N ka Alla la Nii Sɛniman yen, mɛn bɔla sankolo rɔ. A kɛni ikomin kanba. A jiira ka i sii Isa kan ka a to a kan. <verse eid="JHN 1:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 1:33"/>N jɛrɛ tun ma a lɔn fɔlɔ ko ale le, kɔni mɛn ka n kelaya ko n ye na mɔɔilu sun ji rɔ, wo le ka a fɔ n yɛ ko: ‹I wa Nii Sɛniman jiitɔla yen mɔɔ mɛn kan ka to a kan, wo le kɛtɔ Nii Sɛniman najiila mɔɔilu ma.› <verse eid="JHN 1:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 1:34"/>Nde ka a yen. N ye sereya le ri cɛɛ la ko rɔ. A ye Alla Dencɛ le ri.»<verse eid="JHN 1:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la karandenilu fɔlɔ kili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 1:35"/>Lon wo taminnin kɔ rɔ, Yaya ni a la karanden fila lɔni tɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 1:36"/>Yaya ka Isa tamintɔla yen, ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye ai ɲa lɔ Alla la Saa bulan na.» <verse eid="JHN 1:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 1:37"/>Yaya la karanden fila ka kuma wo lamɛn tuma mɛn na, ii bilara Isa kɔfɛ. <verse eid="JHN 1:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 1:38"/>Isa ka a ɲa lase a kɔ ma ka Yaya la karanden fila wo yen mɛn tɛrɛ bilani a kɔfɛ. A ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai ye nfen de kɔ.» Ii ka a jabi: «Rabi, i siini mi?» Rabi kɔrɔ ye le Heburu kan dɔ ko karanmɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 1:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 1:39"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye na. Ai ri wo yen.» Ii nara, ii ka Isa sii yɔrɔ yen. Ii tora a tɔrɔfɛ haan wura dafɛ. Ka a tɛrɛn tele tala a ra tamin haan wura tele waati.<verse eid="JHN 1:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 1:40"/>Mɔɔ fila woilu tɛma, mɛnilu ka Yaya la kuma lamɛn, ka ii bila Isa kɔfɛ, do tɔɔ le ko Andere. Andere ka a kɔrɔcɛ Simɔn Piyɛri le ɲinin. <verse eid="JHN 1:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 1:41"/>A ka a yen waati mɛn na, a ka dantɛɛli wo bɛɛ kɛ a kɔrɔ Simɔn yɛ. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An da Mɔɔ Suwandinin yen, mɛn kɔrɔ ye ko Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin.» <verse eid="JHN 1:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 1:42"/>Andere wara a kɔrɔcɛ ri Isa ma. Isa ka Simɔn mafɛne bɛrɛ bɛrɛ kɛ. A ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ile le Simɔn di, Yuhana dencɛ. I ri i kili le butun ko Sefasi, mɛn kɔrɔ ye Piyɛri<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Piyɛri kɔrɔ ye le ko kaba </char></note>.»<verse eid="JHN 1:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 1:43"/>Wo lon taminnin, Isa ye a fɛ ka wa Kalile. A ka Filipe yen ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Bila n kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 1:44"/>Filipe wo ye Bɛtisayidaka le ri. Bɛtisayida fanan ye Andere ni Simɔn na so le ri. <verse eid="JHN 1:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 1:45"/>Awa, Filipe ka Natanayɛli yen, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nabi Musa la sariya sɛbɛra, a ni nabiilu sɛbɛra mɛn na ko rɔ, an da wo yen. Isa Nasarɛtika le ri, Yusufu dencɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 1:46"/>Natanayɛli ka a fɔ Filipe yɛ ko: «Nasarɛti ri se fen do labɔla mɛn ka ɲi?» Filipe ka a jabi: «Na, i ri a yen.»<verse eid="JHN 1:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 1:47"/>Isa ka Natanayɛli natɔla yen a ma ka a fɔ a ma ko: «Isirayɛlika bɛrɛ bɛrɛ le ɲin di, tɔɲɔli si tɛ a la ko rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 1:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 1:48"/>Natanayɛli ka Isa maɲininka ko: «I ka a lɔn de ko yon de n di?» Isa ka a jabi: «Yani Filipe ye i kili waati mɛn, n ka i yen toroju le la.» <verse eid="JHN 1:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 1:49"/>Natanayɛli ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i ye Alla la Den de ri. I ye Isirayɛli mansa le ri!» <verse eid="JHN 1:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 1:50"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N ka a fɔ i yɛ ko n ka i siini yen toroju kɔrɔ. I ra lemɛniya wo le kosɔn wa? Nba, i ri koilu yen, mɛnilu ka bon wo ri paaɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 1:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 1:51"/>Isa ka do la kuma wo kan ka a fɔ ko: «Ɔɔn. N ye tuɲa le fɔla ii yɛ: lon do natɔ, ai bɛɛ ri sankolo dalakani yen, ka Alla la mɛlɛkailu yen jiini ka yɛlɛ kɛla Mɔɔ Dencɛ ma.»<verse eid="JHN 1:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JHN 2"/>
  <para style="s">Kɔɲɔmalɔ tolon mɛn kɛra Kana so kɔndɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 2:1"/>Nba, a tele sawanan lon, kɔɲɔmalɔ kɛra Kana so kɔndɔ Kalile mara rɔ. Isa na tɛrɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 2:2"/>Isa a ni a karandenilu fanan kilini tɛrɛ kɔɲɔmalɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 2:3"/>A sera waati do ma rɛsɛnji banda fewu. Isa na ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Rɛsɛnji ra ban fewu.» <verse eid="JHN 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 2:4"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N na, nfen ye nde ni ile tɛma? N na waati ma se fɔlɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 2:5"/>A na ka a fɔ baaradenilu yɛ ko: «A ye mɛn fɔla ai yɛ, ai ye wo kɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 2:6"/>Jundaa kabalaman belebele ba wɔɔrɔ tɛrɛ ye ii bolo ye, mɔɔ ri se litiri biseyin haan litiri kɛmɛ ni a kɔ ɲɔɔn kɛla a kɔndɔ. Woilu ye ii bolo ka ii sɛninya mɛn bɛnni ii la namun ma. <verse eid="JHN 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 2:7"/>Isa ka a fɔ baaradenilu yɛ ko: «Ai ye jundaa lafa ji la.» Baaradenilu ka jundaa lafa haan a da la. <verse eid="JHN 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 2:8"/>Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ii ye ji ɲin ta ka wa a ri dɔɔnninta ko ɲanabɔla kunnasiiba ma sisen.» Baaradenilu ka wo kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 2:9"/>Damununta ko ɲanabɔla kunnasiiba a ka ji wo nene, ji mɛn yɛlɛmanda ka kɛ rɛsɛnji ri. A ma a lɔn rɛsɛnji bɔni fan si, kɔni baaraden mɛnilu ka ji ta jundaa kɔndɔ, woilu ka a lɔn. A ka kɔɲɔcɛ kili, <verse eid="JHN 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 2:10"/>ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ wa kɛ rɛsɛnji ratalanna mɔɔilu la, a ye rɛsɛnji ɲumaɲuma fɔlɔ le ratalanna ii la. Ii ɲa wa laminin minin tuma mɛn na, a ri rɛsɛnji gbɛrɛ ratalan ii la, mɛn duman tɛ kosɛbɛ. Kɔni ile ra rɛsɛnji ɲumaɲuma lamara fɔɔ sisen!» <verse eid="JHN 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 2:11"/>Nba, Isa la tɔɔmasere kabannako fɔlɔ le wo ri, a ka mɛn kɛ Kana so kɔndɔ Kalile mara rɔ. Isa ka a la nɔɔrɔ yiraka tende. Wo kɛra sababu ri, a la karandenilu lara a la. <verse eid="JHN 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 2:12"/>Wo taminnin kɔrɔ, a wara Kapɛrinahumu so kɔndɔ, a ni a na a ni a dɔɔcɛilu a ni a la karandenilu. Ii tora ye ka tele dando kɛ ye.<verse eid="JHN 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka julailu gbɛn Allabatobonba la Jerusalɛmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 2:13"/>Nba, Yahudiyailu la Taminkunna Sali tun da sudunya. Wo rɔ, Isa wara Jerusalɛmu. <verse eid="JHN 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 2:14"/>A donda Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ ka julailu tɛrɛn ye, mɛnilu tɛrɛ ye nisiilu ni saailu ni sokɔndɔ kanbailu fɛrɛla. A ka wodifalonnailu siini tɛrɛn ii la tabaliilu kɔfɛ fanan. <verse eid="JHN 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 2:15"/>Nba, Isa ka fojulu kɛ bonsan di, ka mɔɔilu labɔ Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ a ni ii la nisi ni ii la saa, ka wodifalonnailu la wodi gbanan dawuya duu ma, ka ii la tabali labe. <verse eid="JHN 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 2:16"/>A ka a fɔ kanba majiralailu fanan yɛ ko: «Ai ye kanbailu labɔ yan! Ai kana n Fa la bon kɛ julaya bon de.» <verse eid="JHN 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 2:17"/>Isa la karandenilu hankili bilara sɛbɛli kuma wo rɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 2:17">«I la bon na ko gbɛlɛman n ma a ɲa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ ma.»<verse eid="JHN 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 2:18"/>Nba, Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka Isa maɲininka ko: «I ra ko mɛnilu kɛ ɲin, i ri tɔɔmasere kabannakoma su ɲuman kɛ ka a yiraka an na ko ɲin kɛ saratii ye i bolo?» <verse eid="JHN 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 2:19"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ye Allabatobonba ɲin tiɲan, yani tele sawanan n di a lawuli.» <verse eid="JHN 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 2:20"/>Yahudiya ɲɛmɔɔilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An ka Allabatobonba lɔ san binaanin ni san wɔɔrɔ le kɔrɔ. I ri se a lɔla tele sawa kɔrɔ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 2:21"/>Kɔni Isa kan tɛrɛ ye Allabatobonba mɛn ma, a tɛrɛ ye wo fɔla a farikolo le ma. <verse eid="JHN 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 2:22"/>Wo le ka a kɛ, Isa ka i wuli sayabatɔilu tɛma, a la karandenilu hankili bilara a la kuma wo rɔ. Ii lara kuma fanan na mɛn sɛbɛni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, a ni ii lara Isa la kuma fannan na.<verse eid="JHN 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a lɔn mɛn ye mɔɔ sɔnɔmɛ rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 2:23"/>Isa ka Taminkunna Sali kɛ Jerusalɛmu so kɔndɔ. Mɔɔilu ka a la tɔɔmasere kabannakoilu yen, wo rɔ mɔɔ siyaman ba lara a la. <verse eid="JHN 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 2:24"/>Kɔni Isa ma la mɔɔ woilu la baa a ka adamaden bɛɛ lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 2:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 2:25"/>A mako ma kɛ mɔɔ la sereyala, baa a ka a lɔn mɛn ye adamaden sɔnɔmɛ rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 2:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JHN 3"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ni Nikodɛmu la ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 3:1"/>Nba, Farisi cɛɛ do tɛrɛ ye ye, a tɔɔ ko Nikodɛmu. Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔ do le tɛrɛ a ri. <verse eid="JHN 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 3:2"/>A nara ka Isa yen su tun da ko: a ka a fɔ ko: «Rabi, an ka a lɔn ko Alla le ka i kelaya an ma, ka na an karan. Mɔɔ si ti se wo kabannako tɔɔmasereilu ɲɔɔn kɛla ni Alla tɛ a fɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 3:3"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla i yɛ: ni mɔɔ mɛn ma sɔrɔn kokura, wo tii ti se Alla la mansaya yenna.» <verse eid="JHN 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 3:4"/>Nikodɛmu ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ ri se sɔrɔnna cɛmɔɔbaya rɔ ka a kɔsɛ a na kɔnɔ rɔ ka sɔrɔn siɲa fila wa?» <verse eid="JHN 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 3:5"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla i yɛ: mɔɔ si ti se donna Alla la mansaya rɔ ni a ma sɔrɔn ji rɔ a ni nii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kerekikan dɔ nii ni fɔɲɔ bɛɛ ye kelen de ri</char></note> rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 3:6"/>Mɛn bɔni faribanku rɔ wo ye faribanku le ri, mɛn bɔni Nii Sɛniman dɔ, wo ye nii le ri. <verse eid="JHN 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 3:7"/>I kana kabannakoya baa n da fɔ ko: ‹mɔɔ ka kan ka sɔrɔn kokura.› <verse eid="JHN 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 3:8"/>Fɔɲɔ ri a fili ikomin a duman yɛ ɲa mɛn. I ri a mankan mɛn, kɔni i ma a lɔn a ye bɔla fan si, i ma a lɔn a wala fan si. A ye wo ɲa le mɔɔilu fanan yɛ mɛn bɛɛ sɔrɔnni Nii Sɛniman dɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 3:9"/>Awa Nikodɛmu ka Isa maɲininka ko: «Ko wo ye sela kɛla di?» <verse eid="JHN 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 3:10"/>Isa ka a jabi: «I ye karanmɔɔ le ri Isirayɛlika yɛ, kɔni i ma wo lɔn wa? <verse eid="JHN 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 3:11"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla i yɛ: an ka mɛn lɔn, an ye wo le fɔla. An da mɛn yen, an ye wo le sereya bɔla. Kɔni ai ti sɔn an na sereya ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 3:12"/>Ni n ka dunuɲa koilu fɔ ai yɛ, kɔni ai ma la woilu la. A ye di wo rɔ, ni n ka sankolo koilu fɔ ai yɛ, ai ri la woilu la di? <verse eid="JHN 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 3:13"/>Mɔɔ si ma don harijeene rɔ fɔɔ Mɔɔ Dencɛ, mɛn jiini ka bɔ harijeene rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 3:14"/>Nba, waati taminnin, Musa ka duuma sa munuɲa layɛlɛ jiri la wula kɔndɔ ɲa mɛn ma, Mɔɔ Dencɛ fanan ka kan ka layɛlɛ wo ɲa le ma, <verse eid="JHN 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 3:15"/>kosa mɔɔ si wa lemɛniya a ma, wo ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn.»<verse eid="JHN 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 3:16"/>Baa, Alla ka dunuɲa mɔɔilu kanin kosɛbɛ, wo rɔ, a ka a Dencɛ kelen pe di, kosa mɔɔ si wa lemɛniya a ma wo kana halaki, kɔni a ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 3:17"/>Wo rɔ Alla ma a Dencɛ lana ka kiti be dunuɲa kan, kɔni ka a kisi a la baraka rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 3:18"/>«Mɔɔ si wa lemɛniya Dencɛ ma, wo ti jalakila, kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ma lemɛniya wo tun da jalaki, baa a ma lemɛniya Alla Dencɛ kelen tɔɔ ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 3:19"/>Kɛnɛya ra na dunuɲa rɔ, kɔni dibi duman adamaden yɛ ka tamin kɛnɛya la, ka a masɔrɔn ii kɛwaliilu juuman. Kiti beni ii kan mɛn kosɔn, wo le wo ri. <verse eid="JHN 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 3:20"/>Baa mɔɔ si ye kojuu kɛla, kɛnɛ wo ma di a yɛ fewu. A ti sɔn donna kɛnɛ wo rɔ, baa a tɛ a fɛ a kɛwaliilu ye bila gbɛ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 3:21"/>Kɔni mɛn ye taamala ka bɛn Alla la tuɲa ma, wo le ye nala kɛnɛya ma, kosa mɔɔilu ri a yen gbɛ rɔ ko wo tii ra ko mɛn kɛ, a ra wo kɛ Alla la dɛmɛnnin de rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yaya ye sereya bɔla Isa la ko rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 3:22"/>Waati wo taminnin kɔ rɔ, Isa ni a la karanden wara Jude mara rɔ. Ii ka waati dando kɛ ye ka mɔɔilu sun ji rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 3:23"/>Wo ka a tɛrɛn Yaya ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ Enɔn mɛn ye Salimu tɔrɔfɛ. Yɔrɔ wo ye jiman diya ba le ri. Mɔɔilu nara a ma ka ii sun ji rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 3:24"/>Wo waati rɔ, Yaya tɛrɛ ma bila kaso la fɔlɔ.<verse eid="JHN 3:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 3:25"/>Awa, lon do rɔ, sɔsɔli do wulira Yaya la karanden doilu ni Yahudiya do tɛma. Sɔsɔli wo tɛrɛ ye dina sɛniyali landa le kan. <verse eid="JHN 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 3:26"/>Ii nara Yaya tɛrɛn ka a fɔ ko: «Rabi, i kɛra mɛn na sereya ri, Juridɛn Ba kɔma, a ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ. Sisen bɛɛ ra iwa a kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 3:27"/>Yaya ka ii jabi: «Mɔɔ si ti se fen sɔrɔnna a jɛrɛ yɛ ni Alla ma di mɛn ma. <verse eid="JHN 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 3:28"/>Aile mɛn ye yan, ai ri kɛ n na sereya ri ko n ka kuma wo fɔ ko: ‹Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin tɛ n di›, kɔni ‹n ye mɔɔ le ri mɛn na nani a ɲɛfɛ.› <verse eid="JHN 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 3:29"/>Kɔɲɔmuso ye mɛn bolo wo le furucɛ ri, kɔni cɛɛ duɲɔɔ mɛn lɔni kɔ ma, a tolo ye a kan na. A wa furucɛ kan mɛn tuma mɛn na a ri sɛwa bakɛ. Wo rɔ, n sɛwani ka ɲaalen ka dafa. <verse eid="JHN 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 3:30"/>Wo rɔ Isa la ko ka kan ka bonya ka tamin n na ko la, n na ko ka kan ka a majii bakɛ.<verse eid="JHN 3:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 3:31"/>«Mɛn nani ka bɔ sankolo rɔ wo ye bɛɛ kun na. Mɛn nani ka bɔ dunuɲa rɔ wo ye dunuɲa ta le ri. Wo ye dunuɲa koilu le fɔla, kɔni mɛn nani ka bɔ sankolo rɔ wo ye fen bɛɛ kun na. <verse eid="JHN 3:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 3:32"/>A ka mɛn yen a ni a ka mɛn mɛn a ye wo sereya le bɔla, kɔni mɔɔ tɛ sɔn a la sereya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 3:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 3:33"/>Mɛn ka i sɔn a la sereya ma wo ye a yirakala ko Alla ye tuɲa le fɔla. <verse eid="JHN 3:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 3:34"/>Baa Alla ka mɛn nana wo ye Alla la kuma le fɔla, baa Alla ye Nii Sɛniman dila a ma fewu. <verse eid="JHN 3:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 3:35"/>Fa Alla ye a Dencɛ kaninna. A ka fen bɛɛ don Dencɛ bolo. <verse eid="JHN 3:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 3:36"/>Mɛn wa lemɛniya Dencɛ ma wo ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. Mɛn wa a ban lemɛniyala Dencɛ ma wo ti ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔnna, kɔni Alla la mɔne ri to a ma fewu.»<verse eid="JHN 3:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JHN 4"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a ɲɔɔn bɛn Samarika muso la kɔlɔn da la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 4:1"/>Farisilu ka a mɛn ko Isa ye karandenilu sɔrɔnna ka tamin Yaya kan, ko a ye karandenilu sunna ji rɔ ka tamin Yaya kan fanan. <verse eid="JHN 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 4:2"/>(Kɔni Isa jɛrɛ tɛ mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ; a la karandenilu le ye mɔɔilu sunna ji rɔ.) <verse eid="JHN 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 4:3"/>Isa kɛni wo kalema, a bɔra Jude mara rɔ, ka a kɔsɛ Kalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 4:4"/>A taatɔla Kalile, a ka kan ka Samari mara ratɛɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 4:5"/>A sera Samari so do kɔndɔ, so wo tɔɔ le Sikari. A tɛrɛ ye Yakuba la sɛnɛ tɔrɔfɛ, a ka mɛn di a dencɛ Yusufu ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 4:6"/>Awa, yɔrɔ wo rɔ Yakuba la kɔlɔn ye ye. Isa a tɛrɛ ra kɔri taama ma. A ka i sii kɔlɔn da la, tele tala waati.<verse eid="JHN 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 4:7"/>Samarika muso do nara ji ta diya. Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N sɔ ji rɔ n ni n min.» <verse eid="JHN 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 4:8"/>(A la karandenilu tun da wa so kɔndɔ dɔɔnninta santa ɲinin diya.) <verse eid="JHN 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 4:9"/>Samarika muso ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Nfenna ile, Yahudiya cɛɛ, ri n maɲininka ko n ye i sɔ ji rɔ, nde mɛn ye Samarika muso ri?» A damira ye mɛn di Yahudiyailu ni Samarikailu mako tɛ i ɲɔɔn na. <verse eid="JHN 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 4:10"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni i ka Alla la sanba lɔn a ni mɛn ye a fɔla i yɛ ko: ‹n sɔ ji rɔ n ni n min,› ile tun da a maɲininka, a ni a tun da ji don i bolo, ɲenemaya ji kɔnin.» <verse eid="JHN 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 4:11"/>Muso ka a fɔ: «N maari, jilafɛ si tɛ i bolo ka ji ta mɛn na kɔlɔn kɔndɔ, baa kɔlɔn a ra jiini ba le. Ji mɛn ye ɲenemaya dila mɔɔ ma, wo sɔrɔnna mi? <verse eid="JHN 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 4:12"/>Ile, i ka bon ka tamin an benba Yakuba la, an buruju mɛn ka kɔlɔn ɲin di an ma? A ni a dencɛilu a ni a kolofenilu wo tɛrɛ ye ji minna kɔlɔn ji ɲin de la.»<verse eid="JHN 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 4:13"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni mɔɔ ka imin ji ɲin na, ji lɔɔ a ri a mira fanan, <verse eid="JHN 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 4:14"/>kɔni n ye ji mɛn dila, ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka wo ji min, ji lɔɔ tɛ wo tii mira butun fewu. Baa ji wo di kɛ ikomin tenke a kɔndɔ ka ɲenemaya banbali di a ma.» <verse eid="JHN 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 4:15"/>Muso ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, ji wo di n ma. Wo wa kɛ ji lɔɔ tɛ n fanan mira. N mako ti bilala kɔlɔn ji ɲin na butun.» <verse eid="JHN 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 4:16"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye wa i furucɛ kili ka na yan sisen.» <verse eid="JHN 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 4:17"/>Muso ka a jabi: «Furucɛ ti n bolo.» Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ: «I jo ye a rɔ ka a fɔ ko: ‹Furucɛ ti n bolo.› <verse eid="JHN 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 4:18"/>A damira ye mɛn di i ra furucɛ mɔɔ loolu sɔrɔn. Cɛɛ mɛn ye i bolo sisen, i la cɛɛ tɛ wo ri. I ka tuɲa le fɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 4:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 4:19"/>Awa, muso ka a fɔ: «N maari, n da a ɲayen ko i ye nabi le ri. <verse eid="JHN 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 4:20"/>Ande Samarikailu, an burujuilu ka Alla bato koyinkɛ ɲin kan. Kɔni aile Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ ko a fɛrɛ tɛ fo mɔɔilu ye Alla bato Jerusalɛmu le. A ye di wo rɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 4:21"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ai ye la nde la, waati natɔ ai ti Fa batola koyinkɛ ɲin na, wala Jerusalɛmu. <verse eid="JHN 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 4:22"/>Aile Samarikailu, ai ye fen batola ai ma fen mɛn lɔn. Andeilu, Yahudiyailu, an ye fen de batola, an ka fen wo lɔn, ka a masɔrɔn kisi ko bɔni Yahudiyailu le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 4:23"/>Awa, waati natɔ kɔnin, a ra se an ma, Alla batola bɛrɛ bɛrɛ ri Fa bato a sɔnɔmɛ ɲuma la a ni tuɲa la, baa Fa ye mɔɔ wo ɲininna mɛn di kɛ a batola bɛrɛ bɛrɛ ri. <verse eid="JHN 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 4:24"/>Alla ye Nii de ri, a ni bɛɛ mɛn ye a batola ka kan ka a bato sɔnɔmɛ ɲuma la a ni tuɲa la.» <verse eid="JHN 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 4:25"/>Muso ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «N ka a lɔn ko Mɔɔ Suwandinin a natɔ, mɛn ye kilila Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin. A wa na, a ri a bɛɛ ɲafɔ an yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 4:26"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Nde mɛn kumala i yɛ mɛn de ri.»<verse eid="JHN 4:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 4:27"/>Waati wo la a la karandenilu kɔsɛtɔla le tɛrɛ. Ii kabannakoyara ka Isa yen kumala Samarika muso yɛ. Kɔni, mɔɔ si ma a maɲininka ko: «I ye nfen kɛla wa?» Ni wo tɛ, «Nfenna i ye kumala muso ɲin yɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 4:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 4:28"/>Awa, muso ka a la jitafen bila yɔrɔ wo rɔ i kɔrɔkɔrɔ, ka i kɔsɛ so kɔndɔ. A ye taminna a fɔla mɔɔilu yɛ ko: <verse eid="JHN 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 4:29"/>«Ai ye na a ragbɛ. N da ɲɔɔn bɛn cɛɛ do la, a ka a fɔ n yɛ n da fosi kɛ, a ka wo bɛɛ ɲafɔ. A ye Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, wo rɔ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 4:30"/>Mɔɔ le ye bɔla so fan bɛɛ rɔ ka na Isa ma.<verse eid="JHN 4:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 4:31"/>Waati wo rɔ, Isa la karandenilu ka a madiya ko: «Karanmɔɔ, dɔɔnnin kɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 4:32"/>Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Damunin fen do ye n bolo ai ma mɛn lɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 4:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 4:33"/>Wo rɔ, a la karandenilu tɛrɛ ye i ɲɔɔn maɲininkala ko: «Mɔɔ le nara dɔɔnninta di a ma wa?»<verse eid="JHN 4:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 4:34"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N balo ye mɛn di: mɛn ka n nana n ye wo sawo kɛ, fo n ye wo kɛ ka a ban. <verse eid="JHN 4:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 4:35"/>Ai ye a fɔla fanan ko: ‹Yani karo naanin, ko suman nadan waati le wo ri›, kɔni nde ye a fɔla ii yɛ ko: Ai la ɲa lɔ. Ai ye suman tɔnsɔn mafɛne sɛnɛ rɔ. Suman ka waati ra se. <verse eid="JHN 4:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 4:36"/>Mɛn ye suman kala, wo ye a sara sɔrɔnna sisen. Ii mɛn ye ladɛnna, woilu ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn ten. Wo rɔ, sifoyila ni sumankala ri sɛwa i ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 4:37"/>Nba, tuɲa le sanda wo ri: ‹Do ye foyili kɛla dogbɛrɛ ri na sumanka kɛ.› <verse eid="JHN 4:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 4:38"/>N da ai lana sumanka diya mɛn ai ma a baara kɛ fɔlɔ. Doilu ra baara kɛ, a ni ai ra tɔnɔ sɔrɔn woilu la baara la.»<verse eid="JHN 4:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 4:39"/>Nba, Samarika muso wo wara sereya bɔ sokɔndɔ mɔɔilu yɛ ko: «N ka ko mɛn kɛ kɔrɔman, cɛɛ wo ka wo bɛɛ fɔ n yɛ.» Wo le kosɔn, Samarika siyaman lemɛniyara Isa ma. <verse eid="JHN 4:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 4:40"/>Wo le rɔ, Samarikailu nara Isa tɛrɛn ye tuma mɛn na, ii ka a madiya ko a ye waati do kɛ ii wara. Isa sɔnda ka tele fila kɛ ii wara ye. <verse eid="JHN 4:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 4:41"/>Nba, mɔɔ siyaman gbɛrɛilu lemɛniyara a ma a jɛrɛ la kumakan kosɔn. <verse eid="JHN 4:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 4:42"/>Ii ka a fɔ muso yɛ ko: «Fɔlɔfɔlɔ an lemɛniyara a ma i la kumakan de la gbansan, kɔni sisen an da a la kuma lamɛn fanan ka la a la. An lana a la ko tuɲa le. An ka lɔn ko a ye Kisiba le ri, mɛn di se dunuɲa bɛɛ kisila.»<verse eid="JHN 4:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲɛmɔɔba la dencɛ lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 4:43"/>Tele fila taminnin kɔ rɔ Isa bɔra yɔrɔ wo rɔ ka a wa Kalile. <verse eid="JHN 4:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 4:44"/>(A jɛrɛ ka kuma ɲin sereya ko Alla la nabi tɛ bonyanin a jɛrɛ la jamana kɔndɔ.) <verse eid="JHN 4:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 4:45"/>Kɔni ni Isa sera Kalile, Kalilekailu ra a labɛn kun yɛ. Nba ii ra wa Jerusalɛmu Taminkunna Sali kɛ diya, wo rɔ ii tun ka a yen Isa ka ko mɛnilu kɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 4:46"/>Isa ka a kɔsɛ Kana, Kalile mara rɔ. A tun ka ji yɛlɛman so mɛn kɔndɔ ka a kɛ rɛsɛnji ri. Ɲɛmɔɔ tɔnɔman a dencɛ ma kɛndɛ Kapɛrinahumu so kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 4:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 4:47"/>Ɲɛmɔɔ wo tɛrɛ ye kuma mɛnna ko Isa ra na ka bɔ Jude mara rɔ ka na Kalile mara rɔ. Wo rɔ a wara ka wa Isa tɛrɛn ka a madiya ko a ni na Kapɛrinahumu ka a dencɛ lakɛndɛya, ka a masɔrɔn a faatɔla tɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 4:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 4:48"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye a fɛ ka tɔɔmasere yen, fen mɛn ye kabannako ri. Ni wo tɛ, ai ti lala n na.» <verse eid="JHN 4:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 4:49"/>Ɲɛmɔɔ wo ka a fɔ ko: «N maari, na n wara, yani n dencɛ ye faa.» <verse eid="JHN 4:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 4:50"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Wa i wara. I dencɛ ra kɛndɛya.» Cɛɛ wo lara Isa la kuma la ka i kɔsɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 4:51"/>A tɛrɛ ye silala tuma mɛn na a la jɔnilu nara a kun kɔrɔ bɛn. Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I dencɛ a kɛndɛ le tɛrɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 4:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 4:52"/>Ɲɛmɔɔ ka ii maɲininka ko: «A kɛndɛyara waati ɲuman?» Ii ka a jabi: «Kunun tele tala a ra tamin waati kelen ɲɔɔnna a fari sumara.» <verse eid="JHN 4:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 4:53"/>A fa hankili bilara ko Isa ka kuma fɔ a yɛ waati wo le la ko: «I dencɛ ra kɛndɛya.» Ɲɛmɔɔ a lara Isa la, a ni a denbaya bɛɛ.<verse eid="JHN 4:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 4:54"/>Nba, Isa ka tɔɔmasere kabannako filana wo kɛ Kalile a bɔ kɔ rɔ Jude.<verse eid="JHN 4:54"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JHN 5"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka cɛɛ kɔrɔngbɔyanin do lakɛndɛya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 5:1"/>Wo kɔ rɔ, Isa wara Jerusalɛmu Yahudiya la sali lon. <verse eid="JHN 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 5:2"/>Jerusalɛmu dondiya yɔrɔ wo tɔɔ le ko Saa Donda, yɔrɔ wo tɔrɔfɛ, ji lamara diya do ye ye. Gba safa loolu fanan ye ji lamara diya tɔrɔfɛ. Heburuilu ye a kilila Beteseda. <verse eid="JHN 5:2"/><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="JHN 5:3-4"/>Gba wo kɔrɔ jankarɔtoilu siyaman lani ye, ɲa fuyen wo, a ni mɛnilu fari fankelen faani ma, a ni kɔrɔngbɔya jankarɔto fanan.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.3-4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kitabu kɔrɔman kɔndɔ kuma ɲin sɛbɛni tɛ, kɔni kitabu kura kɔndɔ a sɛbɛni ko: Jankarɔto mɛn ye gba kɔrɔ, woilu ye Alla la mɛlɛka makɔnɔla mɛn ye nala ji lamaala tuma tuma. Jankarɔto mɛn fɔlɔ ye jiila ji rɔ wo ri kɛndɛya. A wa kɛ jankarɔ su su ri.</char></note> <verse eid="JHN 5:3-4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 5:5"/>Cɛɛ do tɛrɛ ye ye, mɛn da san bisawa ni san sɛ kɛ jankarɔ do rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 5:6"/>Isa ka a lani yen. A ka a lɔn ko cɛɛ ma kɛndɛ kɛbi waati jan. A ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye a fɛ ka kɛndɛya wa?» <verse eid="JHN 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 5:7"/>A ka Isa jabi: «N maari, mɔɔ tɛ n bolo ka n najii ji rɔ ji lamaa tuma. N wa kɛ wala ji ma, do ri jii ji rɔ n ɲɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 5:8"/>Isa ka a jabi: «I lawuli! I ni la dɛbɛ ta ka i taama.» <verse eid="JHN 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 5:9"/>I kɔrɔkɔrɔ cɛɛ kɛndɛyara. A ka a la dɛbɛ ta ka a taama. (Ko wo kɛra Ɲɔɲɔ lon de rɔ.)<verse eid="JHN 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 5:10"/>Wo rɔ, Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka a fɔ cɛɛ yɛ ko: «Bi le Ɲɔɲɔ lon di! Ka a bɛn sariya ma, i kana i la dɛbɛ ta i bolo ten.» <verse eid="JHN 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 5:11"/>A ka ii jabi: «Mɛn ka n nakɛndɛya, a ka a fɔ n yɛ ko: ‹I la dɛbɛ ta, ka i taama.›» <verse eid="JHN 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 5:12"/>Mɔɔ woilu ka a maɲininka ko: «Cɛɛ yon ka a fɔ i yɛ ko: ‹I la dɛbɛ ta, ka i taama?›» <verse eid="JHN 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 5:13"/>Kɔni cɛɛ mɛn nakɛndɛyara, wo ma a lakɛndɛyaba tɔɔ lɔn. Isa tun da tunun a ma ye, baa jama tɛrɛ ka siya.<verse eid="JHN 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 5:14"/>Kɔ fɛ, Isa ka cɛɛ wo yen Allabatobonba kɔndɔ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ɲa lɔ! I ra lakɛndɛya sisen. I ye hakɛ kɛ boloka fewu, sa ko gbɛrɛ kana i sɔrɔn, mɛn ka juu ka tamin jankarɔ wo kan.» <verse eid="JHN 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 5:15"/>Cɛɛ wo bɔra ye ka wa a fɔ Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu yɛ ko Isa le ka a lakɛndɛya.<verse eid="JHN 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 5:16"/>Wo le rɔ, ii wulira Isa tɔrɔla, baa a darini tɛrɛ ko su woilu kɛla Ɲɔɲɔ lon. <verse eid="JHN 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 5:17"/>Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N Fa ye baarala, haan sisen. N fanan ye baarala.» <verse eid="JHN 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 5:18"/>Jabili wo kosɔn, Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu ka kɛ Isa faa ɲa ɲinin di ka tamin fɔlɔma kan. Baa ii ka a fɔ ko a ma Ɲɔɲɔ lon bonya, ka a la wo kan fanan, a ka Alla kili ko a Fa, ka a jɛrɛ rakanya Alla ma.<verse eid="JHN 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fa ka fanka di a Dencɛ ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 5:19"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: Dencɛ ti se fosi kɛla a jɛrɛ yɛ. A ye Fa yenna mɛn kɛla a fanan ye wo la ɲɔɔn kɛla. Fa ye mɛn kɛla a Dencɛ fanan ye wo kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 5:20"/>Fa Dencɛ duman a yɛ. A ye fen bɛɛ ɲa yirakala a la, a ye mɛn kɛla. A ye ko bailu yirakala a la mɛn di ai kabannakoya. <verse eid="JHN 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 5:21"/>Baa Fa ri sayabato lawuli, ka ɲenemaya di ii ma ɲa mɛn ma, wo ɲa kelen ma Dencɛ ye a fɛ ka ɲenemaya di mɛnilu ma, a ri wo di woilu ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 5:22"/>Fa tɛ mɔɔ si kiti tɛɛla, kɔni a ra kiti bɛɛ to a Dencɛ bolo, <verse eid="JHN 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 5:23"/>sa mɔɔ bɛɛ ri Dencɛ wo bonya ikomin ii ye a Fa bonyala ɲa mɛn ma. Mɛn ma sɔn ka Dencɛ wo bonya, wo tii tɛ a Fa fanan bonyala, mɛn ka Dencɛ kelaya kɔnin.»<verse eid="JHN 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 5:24"/>«N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ ka n na kumakan namɛn, ka lemɛniya n kelayaba ma, wo tii ra ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. Kiti ti bela wo tii kan, kɔni a ra bɔ saya rɔ ka don ɲenemaya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 5:25"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: waati ra se sisen sayabatɔilu ri Alla la Dencɛ la kumakan namɛn, a ni mɛnilu ka a kumakan namɛn woilu ri to ɲenemaya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 5:26"/>Baa Fa wo ye ɲenemaya tii ri ɲa mɛn ma, a ra a Dencɛ kɛ ɲenemaya tii ri ɲa kelen wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 5:27"/>A ka kiti tɛɛ saratii di a Dencɛ ma, baa ale le Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri.<verse eid="JHN 5:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 5:28"/>«Wo kana ai kabannakoya a la ko wo bɛɛ rɔ. Waati ye nala, sayabatɔ mɛn bɛɛ ye kaburu kɔndɔ, wo bɛɛ ri Mɔɔ Dencɛ kumakan namɛn. <verse eid="JHN 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 5:29"/>Ii bɛɛ ri wuli ka bɔ kaburu kɔndɔ. Mɛnilu ka koɲuma kɛ, woilu ri ii wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ ka ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. Mɛnilu ka kojuu kɛ, woilu ri bɔ kaburu rɔ ka wa kiti diya. Kiti ri be ii kan.<verse eid="JHN 5:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sereya siyaman de ye Alla Dencɛ bolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 5:30"/>«N ti se fosi kɛla n jɛrɛ yɛ. N Fa ye mɛn fɔla n yɛ, n ye kiti tɛɛla ka bɛn wo le ma. N ye kiti wo tɛɛla telen de rɔ. Nba n ti ko kɛla mɛn duman n jɛrɛ yɛ, kɔni mɛn ka n kelaya n ye wo sawo le kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 5:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 5:31"/>Ni n ye n jɛrɛ la sereya le ri, n ye mɛn fɔla wo tɛ jatela foyi ri. <verse eid="JHN 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 5:32"/>Kɔni, dogbɛrɛ ye n na sereya ri, n ka a lɔn ko a ye sereya mɛn bɔla, wo ye tuɲa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 5:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 5:33"/>Ai ka kelaya lawa Yaya ma, a ni a ka mɛn sereya ii ma, wo ye tuɲa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 5:34"/>(Nde mako sa mɔɔ la ka kɛ n na sereya ri, kɔni n ye wo fɔla ka bɛn ai la kisi ko le ma.) <verse eid="JHN 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 5:35"/>Yaya tɛrɛ ye le ikomin fitina na mɛlɛnni, ka kɛnɛya labɔ. Ai sɔnda ka sɛwa a la kɛnɛya waati kundunni wo la.<verse eid="JHN 5:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 5:36"/>«Kɔni sereya gbɛrɛ ye nde bolo mɛn ka bon ka tamin Yaya ta la. Nba, baara mɛn donda n bolo n Fa bolo ko ka a kɛ, n na baara wo le ye n na sereya ri. Wo le ye yirakala ko n Fa le ka n nana. <verse eid="JHN 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 5:37"/>N Fa mɛn ka n nana, wo fanan ye n na sereya le ri, kɔni ai tolo ma a la kumakan namɛn fɔlɔ fewu. Ai ɲa ma a ɲakɔrɔla yen fɔlɔ fewu. <verse eid="JHN 5:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 5:38"/>Ai jusukun ma sɔn a la kuma ma, baa a ka mɛn kelaya, ai ma lemɛniya wo ma. <verse eid="JHN 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 5:39"/>Ai ye kitabu sɛniman karanna ka ai miri ko ai ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn kuma wo rɔ. Kitabu sɛniman de ye n na sereya ri, <verse eid="JHN 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 5:40"/>kɔni ai sa a fɛ ka na n ma ka ɲenemaya sɔrɔn.<verse eid="JHN 5:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 5:41"/>«N ti natala mɔɔilu ko mɛnilu ye n tɔɔ ɲuma fɔla, <verse eid="JHN 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 5:42"/>kɔni n ka ai bɛɛ lɔn, ko Alla la kaninteya tɛ ai jusu rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 5:43"/>N da na n Fa tɔɔ rɔ, kɔni ai ti sɔnna n damirala. Ni mɔɔ gbɛrɛ nara a jɛrɛ tɔɔ rɔ, ai ri wo ramira. <verse eid="JHN 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 5:44"/>Ka i ɲɔɔn tando, wo le duman ai yɛ. Kɔni tandoli mɛn di sɔrɔn Alla kelen pe fɛ, ai tɛ wo ɲininna. Ai ri se lemɛniyala wo rɔ di?<verse eid="JHN 5:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 5:45"/>«Ai kana imiri ko nde ri ai tɔɔ la a la n Fa ɲakɔrɔ. Ai bɛɛ la landaɲa ye Musa mɛn dɔ, wo le ri ai tɔɔ la a la. <verse eid="JHN 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 5:46"/>Ni ai lara Musa la, ai tun di la nde fanan na, baa Musa ka n na ko sɛbɛ a la kitabu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 5:47"/>Kɔni Musa ka mɛn sɛbɛ, ai ma la wo la. Awa ai ri se lala n na kumakan wo la wo rɔ wa?»<verse eid="JHN 5:47"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JHN 6"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka mɔɔ waa loolu balo i ɲɔɔn fɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 6:1"/>Wo taminnin kɔ rɔ, Isa wara Kalile Dala kɔ ma. (Do ye dala wo kilila fanan ko Tibɛriyasi Dala.) <verse eid="JHN 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 6:2"/>Jama ba tɛrɛ ye a kɔfɛ, baa mɔɔ woilu ka a la tɔɔmasere kabannako yen, a ka mɛn kɛ ka jankarɔtoilu lakɛndɛya. <verse eid="JHN 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 6:3"/>Isa ni a karandenilu yɛlɛra koyinkɛ do kan ka i sii ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 6:4"/>Yahudiya la Taminkunna sali ra sudunya. <verse eid="JHN 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 6:5"/>Isa ka a ɲakɔrɔta ka jama natɔla yen a ma. A ka Filipe maɲininka ko: «An di se buru santa sɔrɔnna mi, jama ba ɲin di mɛn dɔɔn?» <verse eid="JHN 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 6:6"/>Isa ka wo fɔ Filipe dakɔrɔbɔ kan de ma. Ni wo tɛ kɔnin, a ka a lɔn a ye mɛn kɛla.<verse eid="JHN 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 6:7"/>Filipe ka a jabi: «Hali ni wodi gbanan kɛmɛ fila ye an bolo, wo ti se buru sankɔ bɔla, bɛɛ ri buru kunkundun sɔrɔnna mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 6:8"/>Isa la karanden mɛn tɔɔ ko Andere, Simɔn Piyɛri dɔɔcɛ kɔnin, wo ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: <verse eid="JHN 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 6:9"/>«Kanberen do ye yan, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hori ye suman su kelen de ri, ikomin bile</char></note>hori burukala loolu ye a bolo a ni jɛɛ kala fila, kɔni wo ri se kɛla nfen di jama ba ɲin dɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 6:10"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Jama bɛɛ lasii.» (Bin mɛrɛnin siyaman ba le tɛrɛ yɔrɔ wo rɔ.) Mɔɔilu ka i sii bin mɛrɛnin dɔ. Fɔ diya ii tɛrɛ ri cɛɛ waa loolu bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 6:11"/>Wo rɔ, Isa ka buru ta ka baraka bila Alla yɛ ka a ratala jama la, bɛɛ mɛn siini tɛrɛ ye. A ka jɛɛ fanan datala ɲa kelen wo le ma. Mɔɔilu bɛɛ ka buru ni jɛɛ dɔɔn ka wasa. <verse eid="JHN 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 6:12"/>Ii ka dɔɔnnin kɛ ka fa tuma mɛn na, Isa ka a fɔ a la karandenilu yɛ ko: «Ai ye kunkundun tɔ bɛɛ ta, sa foyi kana tiɲan.» <verse eid="JHN 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 6:13"/>Isa la karandenilu ka hori buru tɔ bɛɛ matɔmɔ ka a kɛ see tan ni fila kɔndɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 6:14"/>Ii ka Isa la tɔɔmasere kabannako yen a banni mɛn kɛla, mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye fɔla ko: «Tuɲa le. Alla la Nabiɲuma le, mɛn na ko fɔni ko a natɔ dunuɲa rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 6:15"/>Wo rɔ, ikomin Isa ka a lɔn ko ii nala a tala fanka la le ka a kɛ mansa ri, a ka a masɛ ii la ka wa koyinkɛ kan, a kelen pe.<verse eid="JHN 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a taama ji kan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 6:16"/>Wura donni, Isa la karandenilu wara dala kanna. <verse eid="JHN 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 6:17"/>Ii yɛlɛra kulun kɔndɔ ka wa Kapɛrinahumu fan fɛ, dala fan kelen ma. Su kora, kɔni Isa ma na fɔlɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 6:18"/>Fɔɲɔ ba ka ji wunwan bakɛ i ɲɔɔn kan. <verse eid="JHN 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 6:19"/>Ka a tɛrɛn Isa la karandenilu tɛrɛ ra kilo loolu ɲɔɔn kɛ kulun kɔndɔ ji kan, waati wo la ii ka Isa natɔla yen, a ye taamala dala ji kan, ka a madon ii la kulun na. Karanden bɛɛ silanda. <verse eid="JHN 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 6:20"/>Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nde le. Ai kana silan.» <verse eid="JHN 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 6:21"/>Ii tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka a don ii la kulun kɔndɔ. Wo rɔ sisen kulun sera ii lɔɔ diya, ii tɛrɛ ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye Isa le ɲininna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 6:22"/>Jama ba tora dala fan kelen ma. Wo duu sa gbɛni, mɔɔilu ka a yen ko kulun kelen pe le wara. Ii ka a lɔn ko Isa ma yɛlɛ kulun kɔndɔ a la karandenilu tɔrɔfɛ. A la karandenilu gbansan bɔra. <verse eid="JHN 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 6:23"/>Kɔni, kulun gbɛrɛ nara mɛn bɔni Tibɛriyasi so kɔndɔ. Isa ka baraka bila Alla yɛ ka buru di mɔɔilu ma yɔrɔ mɛn, kulun woilu lɔni tɛrɛ yɔrɔ wo kɔrɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 6:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 6:24"/>Jama ka a ɲayen tuma mɛn na ko Isa ni a la karandenilu tɛ ye butun, ii jɛrɛ donda kulun woilu kɔndɔ ka wa Isa ɲinin diya Kapɛrinahumu.<verse eid="JHN 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Buru mɛn di ɲenemaya di mɔɔilu ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 6:25"/>Mɔɔilu wara Isa tɛrɛn dala fan kelen ma ka a maɲininka ko: «Karanmɔɔ, i seni yan waati ɲuman na?» <verse eid="JHN 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 6:26"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: n ka tɔɔmasere kabannakoma mɛnilu kɛ ai ɲakɔrɔ, ai tɛ n naɲininna woilu kosɔn de. Ai ye n naɲininna ka a masɔrɔn ai ka buru dɔɔn fɔɔ ka wasa. <verse eid="JHN 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 6:27"/>Nba, ai kana baara kɛ dɔɔnninta mɛn ye banna, kɔni ai ye baara dɔɔnninta mɛn ye mɛnna a ni mɛn di ɲenemaya banbali di ai ma. Damununta wo, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ye a dila ai ma, baa Fa Alla ka a la ɲanɔɔ kɛ a Dencɛ kan.»<verse eid="JHN 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 6:28"/>Wo rɔ ii ka Isa maɲininka ko: «An ye baara su ɲuman de kɛla mɛn duman Alla yɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 6:29"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Alla ka mɛn kelaya, ai ye lemɛniya wo ma. Alla ye a fɛ ai ye baara mɛn kɛ, wo le wo ri.» <verse eid="JHN 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 6:30"/>Awa, ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ile don, i ri tɔɔmasere kabannakoma ɲuman de kɛ, sa an di wo yen ka la i la kuma la? I ri nfen de kɛ? <verse eid="JHN 6:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 6:31"/>Wula kɔndɔ, an burujuilu ka mana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mana wo ye dɔɔnninta le ri, Alla ka mɛn nana Hɔrɔya waati rɔ. Isiryɛlikailu ka wo dɔɔn wula kɔndɔ san binaanin kɔrɔ</char></note> dɔɔn, ikomin a sɛbɛni kitabu sɛniman kɔndɔ ko: ‹A ka dɔɔnninta di ii ma, mɛn bɔni sankolo rɔ.›»<verse eid="JHN 6:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 6:32"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: ko Musa ma buru wo di ai ma mɛn bɔni sankolo rɔ, kɔni n Fa le ye buru bɛrɛ bɛrɛ dila ai ma mɛn bɔni sankolo rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 6:33"/>Baa Alla la buru ye mɛn ye bɔla sankolo rɔ ka ɲenemaya banbali dila dunuɲa ma.» <verse eid="JHN 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 6:34"/>Wo rɔ ii ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Maari, buru wo di an ma waati bɛɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 6:35"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N ye ɲenemaya buru le ri. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n na sila taama ka bila n kɔ, kɔnkɔ ti wo mirala habadan. Ni a lemɛniyara n ma ji lɔɔ tɛ a mirala habadan! <verse eid="JHN 6:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 6:36"/>Kɔni n da kuma wo fɔ ai yɛ ko ai ra n yen ai ɲa la hali wo rɔ ai ma lemɛniya n ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 6:37"/>N Fa ka mɔɔ mɔɔ di n ma, a bɛɛ ri na n ma, ni mɛn nara n ma, n ti wo labɔla kɔma muumɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 6:38"/>Baa n ma jii ka bɔ sankolo rɔ n jɛrɛ sawo kɛ kanma, fo n kelayaba sawo. <verse eid="JHN 6:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 6:39"/>Mɛn ka n nana wo le sawo ye ɲin di, ko n ti bɔnɔla mɔɔ mɔɔ rɔ a ka mɛn di n ma, kɔni n di bɛɛ lawuli saya rɔ lon naban. <verse eid="JHN 6:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 6:40"/>N Fa sawo le ɲin di: ko mɔɔ mɔɔ wa Dencɛ yen ka lemɛniya a ma, wo ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. Dunuɲa laban lon wa se, n di a lawuli saya rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 6:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 6:41"/>Yahudiyailu ka Isa mafɔ damira ka a masɔrɔn a ka a fɔ ko: «N ye buru le ri mɛn jiini ka bɔ sankolo rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 6:42"/>Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Yusufu dencɛ Isa le tɛ ɲin di wa? An ka a fa lɔn, an ka a na fanan lɔn. A ri se a fɔla di, ko: ‹n bɔni sankolo rɔ›?» <verse eid="JHN 6:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 6:43"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai kana dakɔrɔ kuma si kɛ, i ɲɔɔn tɛma. <verse eid="JHN 6:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 6:44"/>N Fa mɛn ka n nana, mɔɔ si ti se nala n ma fo n Fa wa a masɔmɔn ka a lana n ma. Nde, dunuɲa laban lon wa se, n di a lawuli saya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 6:45"/>Nabiɲumailu ka mɛn sɛbɛ wo le ɲin di: ‹Alla ye adamaden bɛɛ karanna.› Mɔɔ mɛnilu wa ii tolo malɔ n Fa la ka sɔn a la karan ma, wo bɛɛ ri na n ma. <verse eid="JHN 6:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 6:46"/>Mɔɔ si ti n Fa yenna, fo mɛn bɔni Alla jɛrɛ rɔ. Wo ra n Fa yen.<verse eid="JHN 6:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 6:47"/>«N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: mɔɔ mɛn lemɛniyani n ma, wo ra ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 6:48"/>N ye ɲenemaya buru le ri. <verse eid="JHN 6:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 6:49"/>Wula kɔndɔ, ai burujuilu ka mana dɔɔn ka sa. <verse eid="JHN 6:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 6:50"/>Kɔni, ni mɔɔ mɛn ka buru dɔɔn mɛn jiini ka bɔ sankolo rɔ, wo ti faala. <verse eid="JHN 6:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 6:51"/>Nde le ye buru ri, mɛn ye ɲenemaya dila mɔɔilu ma, mɛn jiini ka bɔ sankolo rɔ. Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka wo dɔɔn, wo ri to ɲenemaya rɔ kadawu. N di buru mɛn di, wo ye n jɛrɛ fari sobo le ri. N di wo di, sa dunuɲa mɔɔilu ri ɲenemaya sɔrɔn.»<verse eid="JHN 6:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 6:52"/>Wo rɔ Yahudiyailu ka i ɲɔɔn masɔsɔ. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin di se a faribanku donna an bolo di ka a dɔɔn?» <verse eid="JHN 6:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 6:53"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: ni ai ma Mɔɔ Dencɛ faribanku dɔɔn ka a jeli min, ai tɛ ɲenemaya sɔrɔnna. <verse eid="JHN 6:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 6:54"/>Ni mɛn ka n faribanku dɔɔn a ni ka n jeli min, ɲenemaya banbali ye wo bolo. Ko nde, dunuɲa laban wa se, ri a lawuli saya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 6:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 6:55"/>N faribanku ye buru bɛrɛ le ri a ni n jeli ye minni fen bɛrɛ le ri. <verse eid="JHN 6:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 6:56"/>Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka n fari sobo dɔɔn a ni ka n jeli min, wo tii ri to n bolo, n di to wo tii bolo. <verse eid="JHN 6:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 6:57"/>N Fa mɛn ka n kela, a ye ɲenemaya rɔ, n fanan ye ɲenemaya rɔ n Fa wo le kosɔn. Wo ye n ɲa kelen wo le ma, ni mɛn ka n dɔɔn wo ri to ɲenemaya rɔ n kosɔn. <verse eid="JHN 6:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 6:58"/>Buru mɛn jiini ka bɔ sankolo rɔ, wo le ɲin di. A ni buru do ma fen kelen di, ai benbailu ka buru mɛn dɔɔn kɔnin. Ii ka a dɔɔn ka sa, kɔni ni mɔɔ mɛn ka buru ɲin dɔɔn, wo ye tola ɲenemaya banbali le rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 6:59"/>Isa ka kuma wo bɛɛ fɔ ka mɔɔilu karan Kapɛrinahumu salibon de kɔndɔ.<verse eid="JHN 6:59"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa la karanden doilu bɔra a kɔfɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="JHN 6:60"/>Nba, tuma wo le rɔ Isa la karanden siyaman tɛrɛ ye kuma wo mɛnna tuma mɛn na, ii tɛrɛ ye fɔla ko: «A la kuma ka gbɛlɛ ka a lamɛn. Yon di se wo lalɔnna?»<verse eid="JHN 6:60"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="JHN 6:61"/>Isa tɛrɛ ye a kalama ko a la karandenilu ye a mafɔla ii dakɔrɔ kuma ko. A tɛrɛ ye kuma mɛn fɔla, Isa ka ii maɲininka kuma wo ma ko: «Kuma ɲin de gbani ai la wa? <verse eid="JHN 6:61"/><verse number="62" style="v" sid="JHN 6:62"/>A ye di? Ni ai ka Mɔɔ Dencɛ yɛlɛtɔla yen ka wa a bɔ yɔrɔ kɔrɔ rɔ don? <verse eid="JHN 6:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="JHN 6:63"/>Nii de ye ɲenemaya dila mɔɔilu ma, faribanku ti se foyi kɛla. N da kuma mɛnilu fɔ ai yɛ, mɔɔilu ye Alla Nii ni ɲenemaya sɔrɔnna woilu le fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 6:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="JHN 6:64"/>Kɔni mɔɔ doilu ye ai tɛma yan mɛn lemɛniyani tɛ.» Nba, Isa ka a lɔn kɛbi a damira waati ko mɛnilu lemɛniyani tɛ a ma, a ni mɛn ye wala a janfa la. <verse eid="JHN 6:64"/><verse number="65" style="v" sid="JHN 6:65"/>Isa ka do la a la kuma kan ikɔ tuunni ko: «Wo le kosɔn, n ka a fɔ ai yɛ ko mɔɔ si tɛ se sɔnna n ma, ni n Fa ma wo se di a ma.»<verse eid="JHN 6:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="JHN 6:66"/>Ka a tɛrɛn wo lon, a la karanden siyaman ba bɔra a kɔ, ii ma bila Isa kɔfɛ butun. <verse eid="JHN 6:66"/><verse number="67" style="v" sid="JHN 6:67"/>Wo rɔ Isa kumara a la karanden mɔɔ tan ni fila yɛ ko: «Ai lɔɔ ye ai la, ai fanan ye wa?» <verse eid="JHN 6:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="JHN 6:68"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka a jabi: «Maari, an di wa yon kɔ? Ɲenemaya banbali kumailu ye ile bolo. <verse eid="JHN 6:68"/><verse number="69" style="v" sid="JHN 6:69"/>An da lemɛniya a ni an ka a lɔn ko i kelen de Mɔɔ Sɛniman mɛn bɔni Alla rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 6:69"/><verse number="70" style="v" sid="JHN 6:70"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Nde le ma ai mɔɔ tan ni fila suwandi wa? Kɔni mɔɔ kelen ye ai rɔ, mɛn ye Setana ta ri.» <verse eid="JHN 6:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="JHN 6:71"/>Isa kan tɛrɛ ye Judasi le ma, ni a ye Simɔn Sikariyɔti dencɛ ri. Judasi tɛrɛ ye Isa la karanden tan ni fila do le ri, mɛn kɛtɔ Isa janfala ka a don mɔɔ juuilu bolo.<verse eid="JHN 6:71"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JHN 7"/>
  <para style="s">Isa dɔɔcɛilu ma lemɛniya Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 7:1"/>Wo taminnin kɔ, Isa tɛrɛ ye mataamala Kalile yɔrɔ bɛɛ rɔ. A tɛrɛ sa a fɛ ka wa Jude ka a masɔrɔn Yahudiya ɲɛmɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka a faa. <verse eid="JHN 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 7:2"/>Yahudiyailu la Faaninbon sali tun da sudunya. <verse eid="JHN 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 7:3"/>Isa dɔɔcɛilu ka kuma a yɛ ko: «I ye bɔ yan ka wa Jude mara rɔ, kosa i la karandenilu bɛɛ ri a mafɛnɛ i ye ko mɛnilu kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 7:4"/>Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ a tɔɔ ye bɔ, wo tii tɛ a la kɛwaliilu kɛla dokon dɔ. Ni i ye kɛwali bailu kɛla, i ye wa wo rɔ, ka i jɛrɛ yiraka dunuɲa bɛɛ la.» <verse eid="JHN 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 7:5"/>Hali Isa dɔɔcɛilu ma lemɛniya a ma.<verse eid="JHN 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 7:6"/>Wo rɔ, Isa ka ii jabi: «Nde la waati ma se fɔlɔ. Ai kɔnin, waati bɛɛ ka ɲi ai ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 7:7"/>Ai ti se gboyala dunuɲa yɛ. Nde gboyara dunuɲa yɛ ka a masɔrɔn n ye sereya bɔla ko ii la kɛwaliilu ka juu. <verse eid="JHN 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 7:8"/>Ai ye wa sali rɔ. Nde ti wala sali ɲin dɔ ka a masɔrɔn nde la waati ma se fɔlɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 7:9"/>Isa ban kɔ rɔ wo fɔla a dɔɔcɛilu yɛ, a tora Kalile.<verse eid="JHN 7:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa wara Faaninbon Sali rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 7:10"/>A dɔɔcɛilu wani kɔ sali rɔ, Isa fanan wara. Kɔni a ma wa mɔɔilu ɲana, a ka a dokon de ka wa. <verse eid="JHN 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 7:11"/>Sali waati wo rɔ Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye Isa laɲininna. Ii ka maɲininkali kɛ ko: «A ye mi?» <verse eid="JHN 7:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 7:12"/>Jama wo rɔ mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ye i ɲɔɔn masɔsɔla bakɛ a la ko rɔ. Doilu tɛrɛ ye a fɔla ko: «Cɛɛ wo ka ɲi.» Dogbɛrɛ tɛrɛ ye a fɔla ko: «A ye mɔɔilu manɛɛnna.» <verse eid="JHN 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 7:13"/>Kɔni mɔɔ si ma foyi fɔ Isa la ko rɔ gbɛ rɔ, baa ii silanni tɛrɛ Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 7:14"/>Sali lon tala tuma la, Isa wara Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ ka wa mɔɔilu karan damira. <verse eid="JHN 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 7:15"/>Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu kabannakoyara. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin ka lɔnnin ɲin sɔrɔn mi ten, ka a tɛrɛn a ma karan foyi kɛ?» <verse eid="JHN 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 7:16"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N na karan ma bɔ n jɛrɛ rɔ. A bɔni n kelayaba le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 7:17"/>Ni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ ka Alla sawo kɛ, a ri a lɔn ni n ye mɔɔilu karanna mɛn na wo bɔni Alla le rɔ, wala n ye kuma mɛn fɔla na bɔni nde le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 7:18"/>Mɔɔ mɛn ye kumala a jɛrɛ tɔɔ rɔ, wo ye a fɛ mɔɔilu ye a bonya, kɔni mɔɔ mɛn ye a fɛ mɔɔilu ye a kelayaba bonya, wo ye tuɲatii le ri. Wuya si tɛ a la ko rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 7:19"/>Musa le ka sariya di ai ma, wo tɛ? Kɔni ai si ti sariya wo bonyala. Wo rɔ, nfenna ai ye n na ɲininna ka n faa?»<verse eid="JHN 7:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 7:20"/>Jama ka Isa jabi: «Jina le i fɛ. Yon de ye i laɲininna ko ka i faa?» <verse eid="JHN 7:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 7:21"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N da kabannako kelen pe le kɛ, wo rɔ ai bɛɛ ra ai kabannakoya. <verse eid="JHN 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 7:22"/>Ai ɲa lɔ. Musa ka faaninta sariya fɔ ai yɛ. (Kɔni faaninta ko ma bɔ Musa rɔ. A bɔra an benbailu le rɔ.) Wo bɛɛ ni a ta, hali Ɲɔɲɔ lon ai ri ai dencɛilu la faaninta kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 7:23"/>Ɲɔɲɔ lon ai ri se ai dencɛ la faaninta kɛla kosa Musa la sariya kana tiɲan. Nde, Ɲɔɲɔ lon kɔndɔ, nde ka mɔɔ kelen nakɛndɛya fefe, wo sababu la ai muruntini n kanma. Nfenna ko rɔ? <verse eid="JHN 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 7:24"/>Ai kana kiti tɛɛ ai ɲa ka mɛn dɔrɔn yen, kɔni ai ye kiti tɛɛ telen na.»<verse eid="JHN 7:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ye Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri wa?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 7:25"/>Mɔɔilu do mɛn siini Jerusalɛmu ka a fɔ ko: «An na jamanatiiilu ye cɛɛ mɛn naɲininna ko ka a faa, ale le ɲin di wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 7:26"/>Ai ɲa lɔ! A ye kumala gbɛ rɔ, a ni mɔɔ si ti kumala ale ma. An na jamanatiiilu ye a lɔnna fewu ko Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ye wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 7:27"/>Kɔni, cɛɛ ɲin, an ka a lɔn ko a ye bɔla mɛn. Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin wa na mɔɔ si ma a lɔn a ye bɔla yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 7:28"/>Nba, ka Isa to mɔɔilu karanna Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ, a ka a kan ba labɔ ko: «Ai ka n lɔn, ai ka n bɔ yɔrɔ fanan lɔn. Tuɲa wo rɔ. Kɔni n ma na n jɛrɛ ma. Mɛn ka n kelaya, wo le tuɲatii ri. Ai ma a lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 7:29"/>Kɔni nde ka a lɔn, baa n bɔni ale le rɔ, a ni ale ka n kelaya.»<verse eid="JHN 7:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 7:30"/>Awa jama wo tɛrɛ ye Isa ɲininna ka a lalɔ, kɔni mɔɔ si ma se ka a lalɔ ka a masɔrɔn a la waati tɛrɛ ma se fɔlɔ. <verse eid="JHN 7:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 7:31"/>Jama ba woilu tɛma mɔɔ siyaman tɛrɛ lemɛniyani a ma. Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Ni Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin wa na, a ri tɔɔmasere kabannakoilu kɛ ka tamin cɛɛ ɲin ta wa?»<verse eid="JHN 7:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Farisilu ka mɔɔ lawa Isa mira kanma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 7:32"/>Farisilu tɛrɛ ye mɛnna jama ye kuma mɛn fɔla Isa ma, ii dakɔrɔ. Wo rɔ, Sarakalasela kuntiilu a ni Farisilu ka Allabatobonba kɔnɔgbɛnna doilu lawa Isa mira kanma. <verse eid="JHN 7:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 7:33"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N di to ai fɛ waati dando, wo wa ban mɛn ka n kelaya ai ma n di n kɔsɛ a ma. <verse eid="JHN 7:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 7:34"/>N wa wa, ai ri n ɲinin ka kaɲa. Ai tɛna n yenna. Baa n di kɛ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, ai tɛ se wala ye.» <verse eid="JHN 7:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 7:35"/>Wo rɔ, Yahudiyailu ka a maɲininka ko: «A watɔ mi? A watɔ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, an tɛ a tɛrɛnna yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ? A ye wala Yahudiyailu wara le mɛn ni Kirɛkikailu basannin i ɲɔɔnna wa? A ye di? A ri Kirɛkikailu karan wa? <verse eid="JHN 7:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 7:36"/>A ka a fɔ an yɛ ko: ‹Ai ye n naɲinin kɔni ai ti n sɔrɔnna. Ai ti se wala n ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.› A la kuma wo kɔrɔ ye nfen di?»<verse eid="JHN 7:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Nii Sɛniman na ko fɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 7:37"/>Sali lon naban, wo ye lon ba le ri. Wo lon Isa ka i wuli ka kuma ka a kan mayɛlɛ bakɛ: «Ni ji lɔɔ ye mɛn na a ye na n ma ka a min. <verse eid="JHN 7:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 7:38"/>Mɛnilu lemɛniyara n ma, ‹ba ji le ye woyenna wo jusukun na ka ɲenemaya di wo mɔɔ ma,› ikomin a sɛbɛni Alla la kuma rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 7:39"/>Isa kan tɛrɛ Nii Sɛniman de ma, mɛn ditɔ Isa lemɛniyailu ma. Wo tuma Nii Sɛniman tun ma di fɔlɔ, baa Isa tun ma layɛlɛ sankolo rɔ fɔlɔ, ka gbiliya sɔrɔn.<verse eid="JHN 7:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu talara fila ri Isa kosɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 7:40"/>Mɔɔilu ka Isa kumakan namɛn ka a fɔ ko: «Tuɲa le, ɲin ye Nabiɲuma de ri.» <verse eid="JHN 7:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 7:41"/>Doilu gbɛrɛ tɛrɛ ye fɔla ko: «A ye Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri!» Kɔni dogbɛrɛ tɛrɛ ye fɔla ko: «Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di se bɔla Kalile di? <verse eid="JHN 7:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 7:42"/>Nba, a sɛbɛni Kitabu Sɛniman kɔndɔ ko: Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di bɔ Mansa Dawuda la denbaya le rɔ. Mɔɔ Ɲenematɔmɔnin di bɔ Bɛtilɛhɛmu, Mansa Dawuda la so kɔndɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 7:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 7:43"/>Jama ka fara Isa ko kosɔn. <verse eid="JHN 7:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 7:44"/>Doilu tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka a lalɔ, kɔni mɔɔ si ma se ka a lalɔ.<verse eid="JHN 7:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu ma sɔn lemɛniyala Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 7:45"/>Allabatobonba kɔnɔgbɛnna, ii nara sarakalasela kuntiilu tɔrɔfɛ a ni Farisilu. Woilu ka ii maɲininka ko: «Nfenna ai ma na Isa ri?» <verse eid="JHN 7:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 7:46"/>Allabatobonba kɔnɔgbɛnnailu ka a jabi: «Mɔɔ si ma se kumala ikomin cɛɛ ɲin ɲa mɛn!» <verse eid="JHN 7:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 7:47"/>Farisilu ka ii jabi: «Aile fanan manɛɛnnin di? <verse eid="JHN 7:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 7:48"/>A ye di? An na dina kuntii doilu ra lemɛniya a ma wa, wala Farisi doilu? <verse eid="JHN 7:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 7:49"/>Kɔni jama ɲin, mɛn ma an na sariya lɔn, ii ye mɔɔ dankannin de ri!»<verse eid="JHN 7:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 7:50"/>Nikodɛmu, mɛn wara ka Isa tɛrɛn waati taminnin, wo jɛrɛ le Farisi le ri. Wo ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="JHN 7:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 7:51"/>«Ka a bɛn an na sariya ma, an kana kiti labe mɔɔ si kan fɔɔ an wa an tolo malɔ a la ka a lɔn a ye ko mɛn kɛla. Ko wo tɛ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 7:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 7:52"/>Kɔni dogbɛrɛilu ka a jabi: «Ile fanan ye bɔla Kalile le? I ye Kitabu Sɛniman karan ka a lɔn ko: Nabiɲuma ti se nala Kalile.» <verse eid="JHN 7:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 7:53"/>Wo tamin, mɔɔ bɛɛ wara a la bon na.<verse eid="JHN 7:53"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JHN 8"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 8:1"/>Kɔni Isa wara Olibiye koyinkɛ kan. <verse eid="JHN 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 8:2"/>Wo duusa gbɛ sɔɔma da la, a ka a kɔsɛ Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ ikɔ tuunni. Jama ba nara a ma. A ka a sii ka ii karan damira. <verse eid="JHN 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 8:3"/>Sariya karanmɔɔilu a ni Farisilu nara muso do ri, ko wo ra mira kaninkɛ diya. Ii ka a lalɔ bɛɛ ɲakɔrɔ <verse eid="JHN 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 8:4"/>ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Karanmɔɔ, muso ɲin da mira kaninkɛ diya. <verse eid="JHN 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 8:5"/>Nabi Musa la sariya ka an jamari ko: an ye muso su wo kaba labon ka faa. Kɔni, ile ko di?» <verse eid="JHN 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 8:6"/>Ii ka wo fɔ kosa ii di fɛrɛ sɔrɔn ka tɔɔ la a la. Kɔni Isa ka majii ii kɔrɔ ka sɛbɛli kɛ a bolokoinin na duu ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 8:7"/>Ii ka ɲininkali lawara, tuma mɛn na, Isa ka i wuli ka a lɔ ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ii tɛma yan ni hakɛ ti mɛn ma wo tii fɔlɔ ye kaba fili a ma.» <verse eid="JHN 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 8:8"/>Wo rɔ a ka a majii kokura ka sɛbɛli kɛ duu ma fanan.<verse eid="JHN 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 8:9"/>Ii ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, ii ka ii kelen kelen wa damira. Mɛn ka kɔrɔ ii bɛɛ ri wo fɔlɔ ka wa damira, haan muso wo kelen pe lɔni tora Isa ɲakɔrɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 8:10"/>Wo rɔ a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Muso, jama wo ye mi? Mɔɔ ma i jalaki?» <verse eid="JHN 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 8:11"/>Muso ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Mɔɔ si, n maari.» Wo rɔ Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N fanan ti kiti labela i kan. I ye wa ka hakɛ boloka butun.»<verse eid="JHN 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa le ye dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan di</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 8:12"/>Isa ka kuma kura damira jama yɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Nde ye dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan de ri. Mɛn wa bila n kɔ wo tii ti taamala dibi rɔ, kɔni a ri dunuɲaratɛɛ kɛnɛya rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 8:13"/>Farisilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ra kɛ i jɛrɛ sere ri; i la sereya tɛ tuɲa de.» <verse eid="JHN 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 8:14"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Hali ni n wa kɛ n jɛrɛ sere di, n na sereya ye tuɲa le, baa n ka a lɔn n bɔni yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ a ni n watɔ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. Kɔni ai ma a lɔn n bɔni yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ a ni n watɔ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 8:15"/>Ai ye kiti tɛɛla ka bɛn mɔɔilu la sila ma; nde ti mɔɔ si kiti tɛɛla. <verse eid="JHN 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 8:16"/>Kɔni, ni n ka kiti be mɔɔ do kan, jo ye kiti wo fɛ, baa n kelen tɛ wo tɛɛla, Fa mɛn ka n nana wo ye n tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 8:17"/>A sɛbɛni ai la sariya kɔndɔ ko ni mɔɔ fila ka sereya kelen bɔ, wo la sereya ye tuɲa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 8:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 8:18"/>N ye n jɛrɛ la sereya bɔla; Fa mɛn fanan ka n kelaya, wo ye n na sereya bɔla.»<verse eid="JHN 8:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 8:19"/>Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «I Fa ye mi?» Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai ma nde lɔn walama n Fa. Ni ai ka n lɔn ai ri n Fa fanan lɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 8:20"/>Isa ka a la kuma wo lase Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ, yɔrɔ wo ye kankira sii diya le ri mɔɔ ri wodi ja di Alla ma yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. Mɔɔ si ma se a mirala baa a la waati tɛrɛ ma se fɔlɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 8:21"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ fanan ko: «N watɔ le. Ai ri n ɲinin, kɔni ai ri faa ai la julumun dɔ. Ai ti se wala n ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 8:22"/>Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «A ri a jɛrɛ faa wa? Baa a ye a fɔla ko: ‹Ai ti se wala n ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.›» <verse eid="JHN 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 8:23"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ai bɔni duuma, nde bɔni sanma. Ai ye dunuɲa ta le ri, kɔni nde tɛ dunuɲa ta le ri. <verse eid="JHN 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 8:24"/>Wo le n ye a fɔla ko ai ri faa ai la julumun dɔ. Baa ai ri faa ai la julumun dɔ ni ai ma la a la ko: mɛn ye ye, nde le wo ri.»<verse eid="JHN 8:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 8:25"/>Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «I ye yon di?» Isa ka ii jabi: «Mɛn n ka a fɔ ai yɛ kɛbi damira waati. <verse eid="JHN 8:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 8:26"/>N da kuma siyaman ba le fɔ ai yɛ ai la kiti ko rɔ. Kɔni n Fa mɛn ka n kelaya ye tuɲatii ri. N ka mɛn mɛn ale la, n ye wo dɔrɔn de fɔla dunuɲa yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 8:27"/>Ii ma a lɔn ko a ye kumala a Fa la ko le rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 8:28"/>Awa Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai wa Mɔɔ Dencɛ kɔrɔta san ma tuma mɛn na, ai ri a lɔn ko mɛn ye ye, ko nde le wo ri. Ai ri a lɔn fanan ko n tɛ foyi kɛla n jɛrɛ ma. N tɛ foyi fɔla, fo n Fa ka n karan mɛnilu la dɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 8:29"/>Mɛn ka n kelaya, a ye n fɛ waati bɛɛ rɔ. A ma n kelen bila, ka a masɔrɔn n ye ko mɛn kɛla waati bɛɛ, wo duman a yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 8:30"/>A tɛrɛ ye kumala waati mɛn dɔ, mɔɔ siyaman tɛrɛ ye lemɛniyala a ma.<verse eid="JHN 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Iburahima denilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 8:31"/>Wo rɔ, Isa ka a fɔ Yahudiyailu yɛ mɛnilu lemɛniyara a ma ko: «Ni ai ye tola landaɲa rɔ n na kuma rɔ, wo gbɛnin de ai ye n na karanden de ri; <verse eid="JHN 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 8:32"/>wo rɔ ai ri tuɲa lɔn, tuɲa fanan di ai kanhɔrɔya.» <verse eid="JHN 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 8:33"/>Ii ka a jabi: «An ye Iburahima bɔnsɔn de ri; an ma kɛ mɔɔ si la jɔn de fefe! Nfenna i don ye a fɔla ko: ‹Ai ri kanhɔrɔya?›» <verse eid="JHN 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 8:34"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: mɔɔ mɔɔ wa julumun ko ii ye julumun na jɔn de ri. <verse eid="JHN 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 8:35"/>Jɔn ti kɛ denbaya mɔɔ ri; kɔni dencɛ ye denbaya rɔ waati bɛɛ. <verse eid="JHN 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 8:36"/>Ni Mɔɔ Dencɛ ka ai kanhɔrɔya wo gbɛnin de ai ra hɔrɔya de. <verse eid="JHN 8:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 8:37"/>N ka a lɔn ko ai ye Iburahima bɔnsɔn de ri. Kɔni ai ye fɛrɛ ɲininna ka n faa, ka a masɔrɔn ai bannin n kumakan dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 8:38"/>Nde ye kumala n Fa ka mɛn yiraka n na, kɔni ai ka mɛn mɛn ai fa la, ai ye wo le kɛla.»<verse eid="JHN 8:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 8:39"/>Ii ka a jabi: «An fa ye Iburahima le ri.» Isa ka ii jabi: «Ni ai ye Iburahima la den de ri, ai ri a kɛ ikɔ Iburahima ka a kɛ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="JHN 8:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 8:40"/>Kɔni sisen ai ye fɛrɛ ɲininna ka n faa. Nde adamaden mɛn ka tuɲa fɔ ai yɛ n ka mɛn namɛn Alla la. Kɔnin, ai ye mɛn kɛla Iburahima ma wo su kɛ! <verse eid="JHN 8:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 8:41"/>Ai ye mɛn kɛla ai fa ka wo le kɛ.»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 8:41">Ii ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «An ti ɲɔɔn mɔɔ den di. Fa kelen pe le ye an na, ni wo ye Alla ri.» <verse eid="JHN 8:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 8:42"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ni Alla ye ai Fa jɛrɛ jɛrɛ le ri, nde ri diya ai yɛ, baa n bɔni Alla le rɔ. N ma na n na jɛrɛ la ko rɔ, kɔni ale ka n kelaya. <verse eid="JHN 8:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 8:43"/>Nfenna aile tɛ n ɲayenna n ye mɛn fɔla ai yɛ? Ai tɛ wo ɲayenna ka a masɔrɔn, ai ti se n na kumakan mirala. <verse eid="JHN 8:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 8:44"/>Ai fa le Ibulusa ri. Ai ye a fɛ ka mɛn kɛ, wo le duman ai fa yɛ. A tɛrɛ ye mɔɔ faala le ri kɛbi a damira waati. A ti tuɲa lamara la, ka a masɔrɔn tuɲa tɛ a la ko rɔ. A wa wuya fɔ tuma mɛn na, wo bɔni a danya le rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn a ye wuyafɔla a ni a ye wuyailu fa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 8:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 8:45"/>Kɔni, nde ye tuɲa fɔla ai yɛ, wo le rɔ ai lani tɛ n na. <verse eid="JHN 8:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 8:46"/>Yon ye ai tɛma yan mɛn di se a yirakala ko julumun ye nde ma? Ni n ye tuɲa fɔla ai yɛ, nfenna ai lani tɛ n na? <verse eid="JHN 8:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 8:47"/>Mɛn ye Alla fɛ, wo ye a tolo malɔla Alla la kuma la. Ai tɛ ai tolo malɔla baa ai tɛ Alla fɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 8:47"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ni Iburahima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 8:48"/>Yahudiyailu ka Isa jabi: «An jɔ ye a rɔ ka a fɔ ko ile ye Samarika le ri wa? Ko jina ye i fɛ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 8:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 8:49"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Jina ti n fɛ. N ye n Fa le bonyala, kɔni aile ka n kunnajii. <verse eid="JHN 8:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 8:50"/>Nde tɛ n jɛrɛ la gbiliya ɲininna. Kɔni dogbɛrɛ ye nde la gbiliya ɲininna, a ni a ye mɔɔilu la kiti tɛɛla. <verse eid="JHN 8:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 8:51"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: mɛn wa n kumakan nabato wo ti faala habadan.»<verse eid="JHN 8:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 8:52"/>Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Sisen an ka a lɔn ko jina ye i fɛ. Iburahima ra faa, nabiilu ra faa. I kɔnin, i ye a fɔla ko: ‹Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka n kumakan namɛn ka a mira, wo tii ti saya nenela fefe!› <verse eid="JHN 8:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 8:53"/>I mirini ko i ka bon an benba Iburahima ri mɛn da faa? Nabiɲumailu fanan sara. I jɛrɛ kɛla yon di?» <verse eid="JHN 8:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 8:54"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ni n ka n jɛrɛ gbiliya, n na gbiliya ti foyi ri. Mɛn ye n gbiliyala, wo le n Fa ri. Ai ye a fɔla a yɛ ko: ‹Ale le an na Maari ri›. <verse eid="JHN 8:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 8:55"/>Wo rɔ ai ma a lɔn. Nde ka a lɔn. Ni n ka a fɔ ko n ma a lɔn, n di kɛ wuyafɔla ri ikomin ai ye ɲa mɛn ma. Kɔni n ka a lɔn. N ye a kumakan bonyala. <verse eid="JHN 8:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 8:56"/>Ai fa, Iburahima, a ye sɛwala ka n na lon yen; a ka wo yen ka sɛwa.» <verse eid="JHN 8:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 8:57"/>Yahudiyailu ka a jabi: «I ma san biloolu bɔ! I ni Iburahima yen wa?» <verse eid="JHN 8:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="JHN 8:58"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ, sani Iburahima ye sɔrɔn, n ye ye.» <verse eid="JHN 8:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="JHN 8:59"/>Ii ka kaba matɔmɔ ko ii ye a mabon kaba la. Kɔni Isa tununda jama ma ka bɔ Allabatobonba kɔndɔ.<verse eid="JHN 8:59"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JHN 9"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka ɲa fuyen do ɲa laka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 9:1"/>Nba, Isa tamintɔla, a ka cɛɛ do yen a ɲa fuyen de sɔrɔnda. <verse eid="JHN 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 9:2"/>A la karandenilu ka a maɲininka ko: «Rabi, ni ɲin na sɔrɔnbailu ka hakɛ kɛ wala ni ale jɛrɛ le ka julumun kɛ, a ɲa fuyen sɔrɔnni wa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 9:3"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ɲin ma sɔrɔn ka bɛn a jɛrɛ la hakɛ ma wala a la mɔɔbailu la julumun ma. A ɲa fuyen le sɔrɔnda, sa Alla la sebaya ri yiraka mɔɔilu la ale fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 9:4"/>Ni a kɛla tele ri, an ka kan ka baara kɛ a yɛ mɛn ka n kelaya. Su ra sudunya. A wa ko: mɔɔ si ti se baarala. <verse eid="JHN 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 9:5"/>Ka n to dunuɲa rɔ, n ye dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan de ri.» <verse eid="JHN 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 9:6"/>A banni kuma wo la, Isa ka daji labɔ duu ma ka bɔɔ lamun wo la, ka bɔɔ wo ta ka a sisa ɲa fuyen ɲa la. <verse eid="JHN 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 9:7"/>A ka a fɔ ko: «Wa i ko Silowe jilamaradiya ji la.» Silowe kɔrɔ ye le ko «kela». Ɲa fuyen wo ka a wa a ko ji wo la tuma mɛn na, a nara a ɲa yenna!<verse eid="JHN 9:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 9:8"/>A siiɲɔɔ ni mɛnilu ka a yen taralila kɔrɔman na woilu ka a maɲininka ko: «Cɛɛ ɲin de siini tɛ taralila kanma kɔrɔman na wa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 9:9"/>Doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Ale le.» Dogbɛrɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Ale tɛ, kɔni imunuɲani.» Cɛɛ ka a fɔ ko: «Nde le jɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 9:10"/>Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «I ɲa lakara di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 9:11"/>A ka ii jabi: «Cɛɛ mɛn tɔɔ ko Isa ka bɔɔ kɛ ka wo sisa n ɲa la ka a fɔ ko: ‹Wa Silowe ka i ko.› N wara. N banni n kola, n ka yenni kɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 9:12"/>Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «Cɛɛ wo ye mi?» A ka a jabi: «N ma a lɔn.»<verse eid="JHN 9:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Farisilu ka cɛɛ ɲa lakani fɛsɛfɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 9:13"/>Ii ka cɛɛ ɲa lakani wo lana Farisilu ma. <verse eid="JHN 9:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 9:14"/>Awa Isa ka bɔɔ sisa a ɲakɔrɔ da la lon mɛn na a ɲa lakara wo lon de, Ɲɔɲɔ lon de tɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 9:15"/>Wo le rɔ Farisilu ka cɛɛ maɲininka ko mɛn taminni ko a ye yenni kɛla sisen. A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «A ka bɔɔ le sisa n ɲa la, n ka n ko: wo rɔ n ka yenni kɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 9:16"/>Farisi doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Mɛn ka wo kɛ a ma bɔ Alla rɔ, baa a ti Ɲɔɲɔ lon sariya bonyala.» Kɔni, doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Kojuukɛlailu ri se ko makabani su ɲin kɛla di?» Ii talara. <verse eid="JHN 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 9:17"/>Farisilu ka ɲa fuyen mɛn ɲa lakani maɲininka fanan ko: «I ri se nfen fɔla i dandanninna la ko rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn a ka i ɲa laka?» A ka ii jabi: «Nabiɲuma le.»<verse eid="JHN 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 9:18"/>Yahudiyailu tɛrɛ ma sɔn lala a la ko a ɲa fuyen le tɛrɛ, a ni a ɲa ra a laka, sani ii ka a la sɔrɔnbailu kili. <verse eid="JHN 9:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 9:19"/>Ii ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai dencɛ le wa, ai kan mɛn ma ko a ɲa fuyen de sɔrɔnda? Nfen de taminni wa a ye yenni kɛla sisen?» <verse eid="JHN 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 9:20"/>A sɔrɔnbailu ka ii jabi: «An ka a lɔn ko an dencɛ ye. A ɲa fuyen le sɔrɔnda. <verse eid="JHN 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 9:21"/>Kɔni an ma a lɔn fewu ko mɛn taminni ko mɛn a ye yenni kɛla sisen. An ma a lɔn fanan fewu mɛn ka a ɲa laka. A ye a maɲininka, a ra bonya ka kɛ mɔɔ ri, a ri se a jabila a jɛrɛ yɛ!» <verse eid="JHN 9:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 9:22"/>Cɛɛ sɔrɔnbailu ka jabila kɛ ten, ka a masɔrɔn ii silanni Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu yɛ. Baa woilu tun da bɛn a ma ko ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka a lɔ a la ko Isa le ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, ko ii ri wo tii gbɛn ii la salibon na. <verse eid="JHN 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 9:23"/>Wo le rɔ a sɔrɔnbailu ka a fɔ ko: «A ye a maɲininka, a ra bonya ka kɛ mɔɔ ri.»<verse eid="JHN 9:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 9:24"/>Farisilu ka cɛɛ wo kili kokura, mɛn tɛrɛ ye ɲa fuyen di, ka fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye i kali Alla ɲakɔrɔ ko i ri tuɲa fɔ. An ka a lɔn ko cɛɛ wo ye kojuu kɛla le ri.» <verse eid="JHN 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 9:25"/>A ka ii jabi: «N ma a lɔn ni julumuntɔ le walama Kojuukɛla tɛ, kɔni n ye ko kelen lɔnna kɔrɔ, n ɲa fuyen de tɛrɛ kɔni n ye yenni kɛla sisen.» <verse eid="JHN 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 9:26"/>Ii ka a maɲininka ko: «A ka nfen de kɛ i la? A ka i ɲa laka di?» <verse eid="JHN 9:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 9:27"/>A ka ii jabi: «N tɛrɛ ra a fɔ ai yɛ fɔlɔ, kɔni ai ma a lamɛn. Nfenna ai ye a fɛ ka a lamɛn kokura? Ai fanan ye a fɛ ka a kɛ a la karandenilu le ri wa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 9:28"/>Ii ka a manani ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ile le a karanden di. Ande le Musa la karanden de ri. <verse eid="JHN 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 9:29"/>Ande ka a lɔn ko Alla kumara Nabi Musa yɛ, kɔni ɲin, an ma a lɔn a ye bɔla yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 9:30"/>Cɛɛ ka ii jabi: «Hen! Ko makabani ba le ɲin di. Ai ma a lɔn a ye bɔla yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, kɔni a ra n ɲa laka! <verse eid="JHN 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 9:31"/>An ka a lɔn ko Alla ti a tolo malɔla kojuu kɛla la, kɔni a ye a tolo malɔla mɛn ye a bonyala ka a sawo kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 9:32"/>Habadan mɔɔ si ma a lamɛn ni mɔɔ ra mɔɔ ɲa laka mɛn ɲa fuyen sɔrɔnda. <verse eid="JHN 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 9:33"/>Ni cɛɛ ɲin ma bɔ Alla rɔ, a ti se foyi kɛla.» <verse eid="JHN 9:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 9:34"/>Ii ka a jabi: «I ye i la julumun dɔ kɛbi i sɔrɔn waati. I ri an karan wa?» Wo rɔ, ii ka a gbɛn salibon na.<verse eid="JHN 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yon ye ɲa fuyen jɛrɛjɛrɛ di?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 9:35"/>Isa ka a mɛn ko ii ra a gbɛn. A ka cɛɛ wo ɲinin ka a yen, ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye lemɛniyala Mɔɔ Dencɛ ma wa?» <verse eid="JHN 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 9:36"/>Cɛɛ ka a jabi: «Maari, yon ye wo ri? I ye wo fɔ n yɛ, kosa n di lemɛniya a ma?» <verse eid="JHN 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 9:37"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ra a yen. A ye kumala i yɛ sisen.» <verse eid="JHN 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 9:38"/>Wo rɔ a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «N da lemɛniya, n Maari.» A ka a birin Isa kɔrɔ ka a bato. <verse eid="JHN 9:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 9:39"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N nara n nani dunuɲa la kiti la kanma. Ɲa fuyen ɲa ye a laka; mɛnilu ye yenni kɛla, woilu ye kɛ ɲa fuyen di.»<verse eid="JHN 9:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 9:40"/>Farisi doilu tɛrɛ ye a tɔrɔfɛ, woilu ka kuma wo mɛn ka a maɲininka ko: «Ande le fanan ye ɲa fuyen de ri?» <verse eid="JHN 9:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 9:41"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Ni ɲa fuyen ye ai ri, ai tɛ jatɛla julumuntɔ ri. Kɔni sisen ai ye a fɔla ko ai ye yenni kɛla. Wo le kosɔn, ai la julumun da to ai kan fɔlɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 9:41"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JHN 10"/>
  <para style="s">Saa Gbɛngbɛnna bɛrɛ bɛrɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 10:1"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ, mɛn ma i madon saa la wɔrɛ donda la, kɔni mɛn wa yɛlɛ wɔrɛ fan do la, wo ye son ni benkannila le ri. <verse eid="JHN 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 10:2"/>Mɛn donda wɔrɛ donda la wo ye saa gbɛngbɛnna le ri. <verse eid="JHN 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 10:3"/>Wɔrɛ kɔnɔgbɛnna ri da laka saa gbɛngbɛnna yɛ. Saa gbɛngbɛnna ri a la saa bɛɛ kili a tɔɔ la ka ii lawa a ɲɔ rɔ wɔrɛ kɔ ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 10:4"/>A wa ban a saa bɛɛ labɔla, a ri a tamin ii ɲɔ rɔ; bɛɛ ri bila a kɔfɛ, baa ii ka a kumakan lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 10:5"/>Kɔni ii tɛ bilala mɔɔ kɔ ii ma mɛn lɔn. Ii ri ibori ka imase a la, baa ii ma a kumakan lɔn.» <verse eid="JHN 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 10:6"/>Isa ka kuma kɔrɔlama wo fɔ ii yɛ, kɔni ii le ma a lɔn a ye mɛn fɔla ii yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 10:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa, Saa Gbɛngbɛnna ɲuma le ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 10:7"/>Isa ka a fɔ fanan ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ, n ye saa wɔrɛ donda la. <verse eid="JHN 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 10:8"/>Mɛn bɛɛ nara n ɲɛrɔ, woilu tɛrɛ ye sonilu de ri a ni benkannilailu, kɔni saailu ma ii tolo malɔ ii la. <verse eid="JHN 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 10:9"/>N ye donda le ri. Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ wa don donda wo fɛ, wo tii ri kisi. Ii ri don ka bɔ ka ii la balo sɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 10:10"/>Son wo ye nala a suɲali kɛla, ni ta ka a faa, a ni ka tiɲali le dɔrɔn kɛ. Nde kɔnin, n nani sa ii ri ɲenemaya bɛrɛbɛrɛ sɔrɔn, ka a sɔrɔn fasayi.<verse eid="JHN 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 10:11"/>«Nde ye saa gbɛngbɛnna ɲuma le ri. Saa gbɛngbɛnna ɲuma sɔnni ka a nii di saailu la ko kosɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 10:12"/>Mɔɔ mɛn ye baarala wodi la ko rɔ, wo tɛ saa gbɛngbɛnna bɛrɛbɛrɛ ri. Saalu tɛ a jɛrɛ ta ri. Wo le kosɔn, ni a ka wara natɔla yen, a ri ibori ka saailu to ye. Wara juu ri saailu ɲɛnama ka ii lajɛnsɛn. <verse eid="JHN 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 10:13"/>Cɛɛ wo tɛrɛ ye sarala saa kɔnɔgbɛn ko le rɔ, kɔni saailu la ko hamin tɛrɛ sa a la.<verse eid="JHN 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 10:14"/>«N ye saa gbɛngbɛnna ɲuma le ri. N ka n ta lɔn, n ta fanan ka n lɔn, <verse eid="JHN 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 10:15"/>ikomin n Fa ka n lɔn a ni n fanan ka n Fa lɔn. N ye n nii dila n na saailu le kosɔn. <verse eid="JHN 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 10:16"/>Saa gbɛrɛ ye n bolo mɛn ti wɔrɛ ɲin kɔndɔ. N di na iele fanan di. Ii ri ii tolo malɔ n kumakan na ka ii kɛ saa kuru kelen di. Saa gbɛngbɛnna kelen ye saailu wo gbɛngbɛnna. <verse eid="JHN 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 10:17"/>N duman Fa yɛ ka a masɔrɔn n ye n nii dila, sa n di a ta ikɔ tuunni. <verse eid="JHN 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 10:18"/>Mɔɔ si ti n nii tala, kɔni n ye a dila n jɛrɛ yɛ le. A se ye n na ka a di, se ye n na fanan ka a ta kokura. N Fa ka n jamari mɛn na, wo le wo di.»<verse eid="JHN 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 10:19"/>Yahudiyailu talani kokura ka bɛn a kumakan wo le ma. <verse eid="JHN 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 10:20"/>Mɔɔ siyaman ii tɛma ka a fɔ ko: «Jina le a fɛ! Fatɔ le! Ai ye ai tolo malɔ a la nfenna?» <verse eid="JHN 10:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 10:21"/>Doilu ka a fɔ ko: «Ale kuma tɛ jinatɔ kuma ri. Jina ti sela mɔɔ ɲa lakala di?»<verse eid="JHN 10:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa lafilira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 10:22"/>Allabatobonba Sali mɛn ye kɛla Jerusalɛmu san san, wo sera. Nɛnɛ waati le tɛrɛ, <verse eid="JHN 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 10:23"/>a ni Isa tɛrɛ ye taamala Allabatobonba tɔrɔfɛ, Sulemani gbaa da la. <verse eid="JHN 10:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 10:24"/>A tɛrɛ lamininni Yahudiyailu bolo, woilu ka a fɔ ko: «I ye sika bɔla an dɔ waati ɲuman? Ni i ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, i ka kan ka wo fɔ an yɛ gbɛ rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 10:25"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N ka a fɔ ai yɛ, kɔni ai ma la a la. Mɛn ye n na sereya ri, n ye baara mɛn kɛla n Fa tɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 10:26"/>Kɔni, ai ma lala a la, ka a masɔrɔn ai tɛ n na saailu ri. <verse eid="JHN 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 10:27"/>N na saailu le ye n na kumakan namɛnna. N ka ii lɔn a ni ii ye bilala n kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 10:28"/>N di ɲenemaya banbali di ii ma, ii ti bɔnɔla fewu, mɔɔ si tɛ ii bɔ n bolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 10:29"/>N Fa, mɛn ka ii di n ma, wo ka bon fen bɛɛ ri, mɔɔ si ti se ii bɔla n Fa le bolo. <verse eid="JHN 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 10:30"/>Nde ni Fa ye kelen de ri.»<verse eid="JHN 10:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 10:31"/>Yahudiyailu ka kaba ta kokura ko ii ye a bonna woilu la ka a faa. <verse eid="JHN 10:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 10:32"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N da ko siyaman yiraka ai la mɛn bɔni Fa rɔ. Ai ye a fɛ ka n bon kaba la ɲuman de kosɔn woilu rɔ?» <verse eid="JHN 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 10:33"/>Yahudiyailu ka a jabi: «An ti i bonna kaba la ka i faa i la baara ɲuma rɔ, kɔni ikomin i ye Alla lafɛya kɛla. I ye adamaden de ri, kɔni ye a fɔla ko ile le Alla ri!»<verse eid="JHN 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 10:34"/>Isa ka a jabi: «A sɛbɛni Alla sariya kɔndɔ ko: ‹Nde Alla ka a fɔ ko ai ye maariilu le ri.› <verse eid="JHN 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 10:35"/>An ka a lɔn ko Alla ka mɛn fɔ a la kitabu kɔndɔ, tuɲa banbali le wo ri. Awa, Alla ka a la kuma wo lase mɔɔ mɛnilu ma, a ye woilu kilila ko maariilu. <verse eid="JHN 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 10:36"/>Nde, Fa ka n suwandi ka n kelaya dunuɲa rɔ. Kɔni, nfenna ko rɔ ai ye a fɔla ko n ye Alla tanama kuma fɔla, ka a masɔrɔn n ka a fɔ ko: ‹n ye Alla Dencɛ le ri›? <verse eid="JHN 10:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 10:37"/>Ni n ma n Fa la baara kɛ, ai kana la n na. <verse eid="JHN 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 10:38"/>Kɔni ni n ye wo kɛla, hali ni ai ma la n na, ai ye la n na kɛwaliilu la, ai ye a lɔn ka a ɲayen ko Fa ni nde, an ye kelen di.» <verse eid="JHN 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 10:39"/>Ii tɛrɛ ye a lalɔ ko rɔ, kɔni a wara.<verse eid="JHN 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 10:40"/>Isa ka a kɔsɛ Juridɛn Ba fan kelen dɔ, yɔrɔ mɛn ye, Yaya tɛrɛ ye mɔɔ sunna ji rɔ kɔrɔman. A tora ye. <verse eid="JHN 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 10:41"/>Mɔɔ siyaman ba tɛrɛ ye nala a ma, ka kuma damira ko: «Yaya ma ko makabani si kɛ, kɔni a ka foyi fɔ cɛɛ ɲin na ko rɔ, tuɲa le.» <verse eid="JHN 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 10:42"/>Yɔrɔ wo rɔ, mɔɔ siyaman lemɛniyara Isa ma.<verse eid="JHN 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JHN 11"/>
  <para style="s">Lasari la saya ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 11:1"/>Cɛɛ do tɔɔ ko Lasari, a jankarɔra. A tɛrɛ siini Betani so kɔndɔ, Mariyamu ni a nakelenɲɔɔ muso Marita fanan siini so wo kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 11:2"/>Mariyamu ɲin ye muso le ri mɛn ka Maari sen mamun latikɔlɔn na ka a masusa a kunsi la. Wo dɔɔcɛ Lasari tɛrɛ ma kɛndɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 11:3"/>Muso fila wo ka kela lawa Isa ma ko: «Maari, mɔɔ mɛn duman i yɛ, wo ma kɛndɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 11:4"/>Awa Isa ka kuma wo lamɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ ko: «Jankarɔ ɲin ti se saya banna; a ye ye Alla la gbiliya le rɔ, sani Alla la Dencɛ a la gbiliya ye se.» <verse eid="JHN 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 11:5"/>Marita ni a dɔɔmuso a ni Lasari bɛɛ duman Isa yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 11:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 11:6"/>Awa, a ka a lamɛn waati mɛn na ko Lasari ma kɛndɛ, a tora a nɔ rɔ haan tele fila. <verse eid="JHN 11:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 11:7"/>Wo kɔ rɔ, a ka a fɔ a la karandenilu ye ko: «An ye an kɔsɛ Jude ikɔ tuunni.» <verse eid="JHN 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 11:8"/>A la karandenilu ka a jabi: «Rabi, a ma mɛn bakɛ Yahudiyailu tɛrɛ ye a fɛ ka i mabon kaba la ka i faa, diya mɛn dɔ. I ye a fɛ ka i kɔsɛ ye wa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 11:9"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Waati tan ni fila le ye tele kelen di, wo tɛ? Ni mɔɔ taamara tele kɔrɔ a ti a sennatula, ka a masɔrɔn a ye dunuɲa kɛnɛ yenna. <verse eid="JHN 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 11:10"/>Kɔni ni mɔɔ taamara su rɔ, a ri a sennatu ka a masɔrɔn a ɲa sa kɛnɛya la.»<verse eid="JHN 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 11:11"/>A banni wo bɛɛ fɔla, Isa ka do la kuma wo ka a fɔ ko: «An duɲɔɔncɛ Lasari sunɔɔtɔ. N watɔ a lakunun diya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 11:12"/>Karandenilu ka a jabi: «Maari, ni a sunɔɔtɔ le, a ri kɛndɛya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 11:13"/>Awa, Isa tɛrɛ ye kumala a la saya ko le rɔ, kɔni woilu mirini ko a sunɔɔtɔ le. <verse eid="JHN 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 11:14"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ gbɛ rɔ ko: «Lasari ra sa. <verse eid="JHN 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 11:15"/>N sɛwani ba ai kosɔn ko n tɛrɛ ti ye, kosa ai ri lemɛniya. Kɔni, an ye wa a tɛrɛn yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 11:16"/>Wo rɔ Tomasi (mɛn tɛrɛ ye kilila ko filani) ka a fɔ karanden toilu yɛ ko: «An fanan ye wa, kosa an di faa a fɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa le su lawulila ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 11:17"/>Isa kɔseyini ka a tɛrɛn Lasari su tun da tele naanin kɛ kaburu rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 11:18"/>(Betani so ni Jerusalɛmu tɛmala ye kilo sawa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 11:19"/>Wo rɔ, Yahudiya siyaman da na Marita ni Mariyamu wara ii dɔɔcɛ saya fɔ diya, ka ii masabari ii dɔɔcɛ la saya ko rɔ.) <verse eid="JHN 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 11:20"/>Marita ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Isa ra na, a wara a labɛn, kɔni Mariyamu siini tora bon na. <verse eid="JHN 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 11:21"/>Marita ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Maari, ni i tɛrɛ ye yan, n dɔɔcɛ tɛrɛ tɛ sa. <verse eid="JHN 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 11:22"/>Kɔni sisen n ka a lɔn ko ni i ye foyi maɲininkala Alla bolo, Alla ri sɔn wo ma.»<verse eid="JHN 11:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 11:23"/>Isa ka a jabi: «I dɔɔcɛ, a ri wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 11:24"/>Marita ka a fɔ ko: «N ka a lɔn ko su wa wuli tuma mɛn na laban lon, n dɔɔcɛ fanan di wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 11:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 11:25"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Nde ye su lawulila le ri. Nde ye ɲenemaya le ri fanan. Mɛn wa lemɛniya n na, hali ni a wa sa a ri ɲenemaya. <verse eid="JHN 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 11:26"/>Mɔɔ si wa kɛ dunuɲa rɔ ka a la lemɛniya la n dɔ, wo ti saya sɔrɔn habadan. I lani wo la?» <verse eid="JHN 11:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 11:27"/>A ka a jabi: «Maari, n lani a la ko i ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin de ri, Alla Dencɛ, mɛn nani dunuɲa rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 11:28"/>A banni wo fɔla, a wara a dɔɔmuso Mariyamu kili ka a fɔ a yɛ sutura rɔ ko: «Karanmɔɔ ra na, a ye i kilila.» <verse eid="JHN 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 11:29"/>Mariyamu ka kuma wo lamɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka i wuli ka ibori ka wa Isa diya. <verse eid="JHN 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 11:30"/>Isa tɛrɛ ma don so ɲin dɔ fɔlɔ, kɔni a tɛrɛ ye nɔ rɔ, Marita nara a la bɛn yɔrɔ mɛn. <verse eid="JHN 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 11:31"/>Yahudiyailu mɛnilu tɛrɛ nani Mariyamu saya fɔ diya, woilu ka a yen a ra wuli i kɔrɔkɔrɔ ka a bɔ ka wa tuma mɛn na, ii mirini ko a ye wala kaburu da la ka wa a kasi.<verse eid="JHN 11:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 11:32"/>A se mɛn kɛra ye Isa tɛrɛ yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, Mariyamu bera a sen kɔrɔ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, ni i tɛrɛ ye yan n dɔɔcɛ tɛrɛ tɛ sala!» <verse eid="JHN 11:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 11:33"/>Isa ka a yen kasila a ni Yahudiya mɛnilu nara a kɔfɛ, Isa sɔnɔmɛ yɛrɛyɛrɛra ka a sunun. <verse eid="JHN 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 11:34"/>A ka a maɲininka ko: «Ai ka a la mi?» Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, na a mafɛnɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 11:35"/>Isa kasira. <verse eid="JHN 11:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 11:36"/>Wo rɔ Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ra yen, a duman a yɛ ɲa mɛn dɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 11:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 11:37"/>Kɔni doilu tɛrɛ ye a fɔla ko: «Mɛn ka ɲa fuyen ɲa laka, a ti se ɲin lakɛndɛyala wa?»<verse eid="JHN 11:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Lasari su lawuli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 11:38"/>Ikɔ tuunni Isa sɔnɔmɛ yɛrɛyɛrɛra. A sera kaburu da la. Kaburu tɛrɛ ye falan de ri. A da tɛrɛ latuunni kaba ba le la. <verse eid="JHN 11:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 11:39"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Kaba bɔ da la.» Sayabatɔ nakelenɲɔɔ muso, Marita ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, a suma ye a bɔla. A ra tele naanin bɔ a ye yan.» <verse eid="JHN 11:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 11:40"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N ma a fɔ i yɛ ko ni i lemɛniyala, i ri Alla la gbiliya yen?» <verse eid="JHN 11:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 11:41"/>Wo rɔ ii ka kaba bɔ ye. Isa ka a ɲakɔrɔta, ka a fɔ ko: «Fa, n ye baraka bila i la, baa i ka i tolo malɔ n na. <verse eid="JHN 11:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 11:42"/>N ka a lɔn ko i ye i tolo malɔla n na waati bɛɛ; kɔni ka a masɔrɔn n namininni jama mɛn bolo n ye kumala i yɛ, sa ii ri lemɛniya a la ko ile le ka n kelaya.» <verse eid="JHN 11:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 11:43"/>A ka wo fɔ tuma mɛn na, a ka a kan ba labɔ ko: «Lasari, bɔ gbɛ ma!» <verse eid="JHN 11:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 11:44"/>Su wulira ka bɔ. A sen ni a bolo bɛɛ mamininni kasankɛ rɔ, a ɲakɔrɔla tununni jala la. Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye kasankɛ bɔ a ma, ai ye a bila, a ye wa.»<verse eid="JHN 11:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu ka janfa don Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 11:45"/>Yahudiya siyaman ba mɛn nara Mariyamu kɔfɛ, ka a yen Isa ka ko mɛn kɛ, ii ka ii lemɛniya la a rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 11:46"/>Kɔni doilu bɔra ii tɛma ka wa a dantɛɛli kɛ Farisilu yɛ Isa ka ko mɛn kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 11:47"/>Awa, sarakalasela kuntiilu a ni Farisilu ka kiti tɛɛ dɛkuru ladɛn ka a fɔ ko: «An di nfen de kɛ? Cɛɛ ɲin da tɔɔmasere kabannako siyaman kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 11:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 11:48"/>Ni an ka a to a jɛrɛ ma, dunuɲa bɛɛ ri lemɛniya a la. Wo rɔ Rɔmukailu ri na ka an na yɔrɔ tiɲan ka an na siya fanan halaki.»<verse eid="JHN 11:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 11:49"/>Do ye ii tɛma ye mɛn tɔɔ ko Kayifasi, san wo la wo le tɛrɛ ye sarakalasela la kuntiiya la. Wo ka kuma ta ko: «Ai ma foyi lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 11:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 11:50"/>Ai ma a yen, ni mɔɔ kelen di faa jama nɔ rɔ sa an na siya bɛɛ kana halaki, wo le ka fisa ai ma wa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JHN 11:51"/>A sa ɲin fɔla a jɛrɛ yɛ; kɔni ikomin a tɛrɛ ye sarakalasela kuntiiya la san wo la, a kumara ikomin nabi ko Isa ri na sa Yahudiya siya nɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JHN 11:52"/>Kɔni Isa ri sa mɛnilu nɔ rɔ, Yahudiya siya kelen ko tɛ. A ri sa ka Alla denilu bɛɛ ladɛn denbaya kelen di mɛnilu siini dunuɲa bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 11:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JHN 11:53"/>Ka bɔ lon kelen wo le Yahudiyailu bɛnni tɛrɛ a ma ko ii ri Isa faa ɲa ɲinin.<verse eid="JHN 11:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="JHN 11:54"/>Wo rɔ Isa ka jɛrɛ yiraka lalɔ jama yɛ. A bɔra mara wo rɔ ka wa wula ba kɔndɔ, ka a se so mɛn tɔɔ ko Efirayimu. A ni a la karandenilu tora ye dɔɔni.<verse eid="JHN 11:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="JHN 11:55"/>Taminkunna Sali wa sudunya tuma mɛn na, jamana siyaman mɔɔilu ye nala Jerusalɛmu sani sali ye se ii ri ii jɛrɛ sɛninya ka a bɛn ii la namun ma. <verse eid="JHN 11:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JHN 11:56"/>Ii tɛrɛ ye Isa ɲininna ii jɛrɛ ma Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ, ka i ɲɔɔn maɲininka ko: «Ai miriya ye nfen di? A ti nala sali rɔ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 11:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JHN 11:57"/>Sarakalasela kuntiilu a ni Farisilu ka jamarili di ko ni mɔɔ ka a lɔn a yɔrɔ mɛn na, a ri se a yirakala sa ii di se a mirala ɲa mɛn.<verse eid="JHN 11:57"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JHN 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mariyamu ka Isa sen mamun tulu sumaduman na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 12:1"/>A tɛrɛ tuunni tele wɔɔrɔ le ma Taminkunna Sali ye se, Isa nara Betani, Lasari ye siini so mɛn dɔ, Isa ka Lasari mɛn lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 12:2"/>Ii ka a fanda ka a bonya. Marita tɛrɛ ye dɔɔnnin dila ii ma. Lasari siini tɛrɛ mɔɔilu tɛma dɔɔnnin diya. <verse eid="JHN 12:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 12:3"/>Wo rɔ, Mariyamu ka tulu suma duman dagbɛlɛ litiri tala ta, tulu suma duman mɛn tɔɔ ko naridi. A ka Isa sen mamun wo la ka a kunsi ta ka Isa sen mamun toto. Bonkɔndɔla bɛɛ kɛra tulu suma duman suma le ri.<verse eid="JHN 12:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 12:4"/>Kɔni, Judasi Sikariyɔti, mɛn tɛrɛ ye Isa la karanden do ri, mɛn di janfa don Isa ma, wo ka a fɔ ko: <verse eid="JHN 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 12:5"/>«Nfenna an ma latikɔlɔn ɲin san ka a sankɔ di bolokolonilu ma? Latikɔlɔn wo sankɔ ye bɛnna baaraden kelen san sara le ma.» <verse eid="JHN 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 12:6"/>Ni a kumara ɲa wo ma, wo tɛ ko a haminni bolokolonilu la ko rɔ, kɔni a tɛrɛ ye son de ri. A tɛrɛ ye wodi lamarala le ri, kɔni a tɛrɛ ye wodi wo tala ka a kɛ a jɛrɛ ta ri. <verse eid="JHN 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 12:7"/>Kɔni Isa ka a fɔ ko: «A ye a to ye. A ra latikɔlɔn sumaduman ɲin donna ka bɛn n su don lon mɛn na. <verse eid="JHN 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 12:8"/>Bolokolonilu ye i fɛ waati bɛɛ rɔ. Kɔni nde, n ti tola ai fɛ waati bɛɛ rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 12:9"/>Yahudiya jama ba ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na, a ye ye, ii nara. Ii ma na Isa kelen yen diya, kɔni ii nara mɛn Lasari le yen diya (Lasari mɛn nawulira ka bɔ saya rɔ). <verse eid="JHN 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 12:10"/>Sarakalasela kuntiilu ka miriya ko ka Lasari fanan faa, <verse eid="JHN 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 12:11"/>ka a masɔrɔn ale ta fan dɔ Yahudiyailu siyaman ba lemɛniyara Isa ma wo rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa donda Jerusalɛmu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 12:12"/>Wo duusa gbɛ, jama siyaman ba mɛn nara Jerusalɛmu sali diya ka a mɛn ko Isa natɔ Jerusalɛmu. <verse eid="JHN 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 12:13"/>Ii ka tamaro bolon ta ka wa a labɛn ka ii sɛwa kan nabɔ ko:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Alla tando!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Duwawu ye a yɛ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JHN 12:13">Mɛn ye nala Maari tɔɔ rɔ ten!»</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:13">«Duwawu ye Isirayɛli Mansa Ba yɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 12:14"/>Isa ka sofalini bulan do yen ka i sii wo kan ikɔ sɛbɛni ɲa mɛn:<verse eid="JHN 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 12:15"/>«I kana silan, Siyonkailu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">A ragbɛ, ai la mansa ye nala,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:15">masiini falini bulan kan.»<verse eid="JHN 12:15"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 12:16"/>Waati wo la a la karandenilu wo ma a ɲayen ko mɛn ye taminna, kɔni Isa ka a la gbiliya labɔ tuma mɛn na, ii ka lɔn ko wo bɛɛ sɛbɛnni Alla la kitabu kɔndɔ, a ni mɔɔilu tɛrɛ ka wo bɛɛ kɛ Isa yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 12:17"/>Nba, jama ba tɛrɛ ye Isa fɛ wo lon, a ka Lasari kili ka bɔ kaburu kɔndɔ lon mɛn ko a ye lawuli ka bɔ saya rɔ tuma mɛn na, woilu kɛra a sereya ri. <verse eid="JHN 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 12:18"/>Wo rɔ jama ba nara a labɛn diya, ka a masɔrɔn ii ra a mɛn ko a ra kabannako wo kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 12:19"/>Wo rɔ Farisilu tɛrɛ ye a fɔla i ɲɔɔn tɛma ko: «Ai ma yen ai ti se foyi kɛla. A ragbɛ! Dunuɲa bɛɛ ye bilala a kɔfɛ!»<verse eid="JHN 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kirɛkika doilu ye a fɛ ka kuma Isa yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 12:20"/>Mɛnilu nara Alla bato diya Jerusalɛmu sali lon, Kirɛkika doilu fanan tɛrɛ ye ii tɛma. <verse eid="JHN 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 12:21"/>Woilu nara Filipe madon, Filipe mɛn nani ka bɔ Bɛtisayida so kɔndɔ Kalile mara rɔ. Woilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An fa, an ye a fɛ ka Isa yen.» <verse eid="JHN 12:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 12:22"/>Filipe nara wo fɔ Andere yɛ. Ii fila nara wo fɔ Isa yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 12:23"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «Mɔɔ Dencɛ gbiliya waati ra se, sisen. <verse eid="JHN 12:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 12:24"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: ni suman kisɛ kelen ma be duuma, ka a faa, a kelen pe ri to. Kɔni, ni a faara, a ri wa a den siyaman di a la. <verse eid="JHN 12:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 12:25"/>Mɛn nii duman a yɛ, a ri bɔnɔ; kɔni mɛn nii ma diya a yɛ dunuɲa rɔ wo ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 12:26"/>Mɛn ye a fɛ ka n na baara kɛ n yɛ, wo ye bila n kɔfɛ. N ye yɔrɔ mɛn na, n na baaraden fanan di tɛrɛn ye. Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ wa n na baara kɛ n yɛ, N Fa ri wo bonya.<verse eid="JHN 12:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 12:27"/>«Sisen n sɔlɔmɛ ra yɛrɛyɛrɛ. N di nfen fɔ? N di a fɔ ko: ‹Tɔrɔya mɛn kɛtɔ n sɔrɔnna sisen, Fa n kisi wo ma› wa? Wo tɛ, kɔni ka a masɔrɔn tɔrɔya mɛn ye n sɔrɔnna wo waati ra se! <verse eid="JHN 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 12:28"/>N Fa, i tɔɔ labɔ i gbiliya rɔ.» Wo rɔ, kumakan do bɔra sankolo rɔ ko: «N da n tɔɔ labɔ gbiliya rɔ, n di n tɔɔ labɔ gbiliya rɔ kokura.» <verse eid="JHN 12:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 12:29"/>Jama ba mɛn tɛrɛ ye ye, mɛn ka mankan wo mɛn, ii ka a fɔ ko sanfɛrɛn kan da bɔ. Doilu fanan ka a fɔ ko mɛlɛka le kumala a yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 12:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 12:30"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Kumakan ɲin ma fɔ nde dɛmɛn kanma, kɔni a fɔni aile ta le. <verse eid="JHN 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 12:31"/>Nba, sisen dunuɲa la kiti le; dunuɲa kuntii juu ri gbɛn sisen. <verse eid="JHN 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 12:32"/>Kɔni nde, n wa kɔrɔta duukolo ma, n di mɔɔ bɛɛ masɔmɔn ka na n ma.» <verse eid="JHN 12:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 12:33"/>A ka wo fɔ kosa a ri a faa ɲa yiraka ii ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 12:34"/>Wo rɔ jama ka a jabi: «An ka a lamɛn sariya le rɔ ko: Ɲenematɔmɔnin ye tola le habadan. I ye nfen fɔla ten ko: ‹Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri kɔrɔta›? Yon ye Mɔɔ Dencɛ ri?» <verse eid="JHN 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 12:35"/>Wo rɔ Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan ye a tola ai tɔrɔfɛ waatini. Ai ye taama ai ni dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan yen waati mɛn, sani dibi ye don ai ma waati mɛn. Baa mɛn ye taamala dibi rɔ wo ma a lɔn a ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn na. <verse eid="JHN 12:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 12:36"/>Ai ni kɛnɛbɔlan yen waati mɛn dɔ, ai ye lemɛniya la kɛnɛbɔlan dɔ, wo wa kɛ ai ri kɛ kɛnɛbɔlan den di.» Isa ban mɛn kɛra wo fɔla, a wara ka a dokon woilu ma.<verse eid="JHN 12:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mɔɔilu ma lemɛniya Isa ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 12:37"/>Hali Isa ka kabannako siyaman kɛ ii ɲakɔrɔ, ii ma lemɛniya a ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 12:38"/>Wo ko ra a dafa Nabi Esayi ka mɛn fɔ ko: «Maari, yon lemɛniyani an na kuma ma? Maari, i ra i la sebaya yiraka yon na?» <verse eid="JHN 12:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 12:39"/>Wo le kosɔn ii ma se lemɛniyala a ma, baa ikomin Nabi Esayi ka a fɔ fanan ko:<verse eid="JHN 12:39"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 12:40"/>«A ka ii ɲa lasidi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ka ii jusu gbɛlɛya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">wo rɔ ii ɲa kana fen yen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ii jusu kun kana a ɲayen,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">ii kana ii kosɛ n ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="JHN 12:40">sa n di se ii lakɛndɛyala ɲa mɛn ma.»<verse eid="JHN 12:40"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 12:41"/>Nabi Esayi ka wo fɔ ka a masɔrɔn a tɛrɛ ye Isa la gbiliya yenna ka a kuma a la ko rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 12:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 12:42"/>Waati wo rɔ, hali mɔɔbakɔrɔilu tɛma mɔɔ siyaman lemɛniyara a ma. Kɔni ka a masɔrɔn Farisilu ta fan dɔ ii ma sɔn ka ii lɔ ko Isa ye Ɲenematɔmɔnin di. Ii tɛrɛ ye silanni ko Farisilu ri gbɛn salibon kɔndɔ, <verse eid="JHN 12:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JHN 12:43"/>baa mɔɔilu la gbiliya duman ii yɛ ka a tamin Alla la gbiliya la.<verse eid="JHN 12:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="JHN 12:44"/>Isa ka a kan ba labɔ ka a fɔ ko: «Ni mɔɔ mɛn lemɛniyara n ma, a ma lemɛniya nde kelen ma, kɔni mɛn ka n kelaya a lemɛniyara wo fanan ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JHN 12:45"/>Mɛn ka n yen, wo ra n kelayaba fanan yen. <verse eid="JHN 12:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JHN 12:46"/>N nani ka a kɛ dunuɲa kɛnɛbɔlan de ri, wo rɔ mɔɔ mɔɔ wa lemɛniya n ma wo tii ti to dibi rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JHN 12:47"/>Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ka n kumakan namɛn, kɔni a ma a mira, nde tɛ a kiti tɛɛla; baa n ma na kiti labe kanma dunuɲa kan, kɔni n nani dunuɲa kisi diya le. <verse eid="JHN 12:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JHN 12:48"/>Ni mɔɔ mɛn ka a ban n dɔ, ka a ban n na kuma mirala, fen ye ye mɛn di kiti labe wo tii kan. Fen wo ye n na kumailu ri. N ka kuma mɛnilu fɔ, woilu le ri kiti labe a kan dunuɲa laban lon. <verse eid="JHN 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JHN 12:49"/>Baa n sa kumala n jɛrɛ yɛ, kɔni n Fa mɛn ka n kelaya, wo le jɛrɛ ka n jamari n ka kan ka mɛnilu fɔ a ni n ka kan ka kuma mɛn bɔ ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="JHN 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="JHN 12:50"/>Wo rɔ n ka a lɔn ko a la jamari ye ɲenemaya banbali dila. Sisen n ye kumala wo le rɔ n Fa ka a fɔ ko n ye mɛn fɔ, n ye wo le fɔla.»<verse eid="JHN 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JHN 13"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a la karandenilu sen mako</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 13:1"/>Sani Taminkunna Sali ye se, Isa ka a lɔn ko a la waati ra dafa ko a ye bɔ dunuɲa rɔ ka wa a Fa ma. Wo le rɔ a ta mɛn dunuɲa rɔ woilu diyara a yɛ a ka a kaninteya ba yiraka woilu la haan ka a dan natamin. <verse eid="JHN 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 13:2"/>Wura fɛ dɔɔnninta le tɛrɛ. Ibulusa ra Isa janfa miriya don Simɔn Sikariyɔti dencɛ Judasi jusu rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 13:3"/>Isa ka a lɔn ko a Fa ra fen bɛɛ karifa a la, ko a bɔni Alla le rɔ, ale kɔsɛla Alla le ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 13:4"/>Wo rɔ a ka a lawuli tabali kunna, ka a la durikiba bɔ a kan na, ka funduni sidi a la. <verse eid="JHN 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 13:5"/>A banni wo kɛla a ka ji kɛ koli muran dɔ ka a la karandenilu sen mako damira, ka funduni sidini ta ka ii sen matoto.<verse eid="JHN 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 13:6"/>A se mɛn kɛra Simɔn Piyɛri ma, wo ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, ile ri n sen mako wa?» <verse eid="JHN 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 13:7"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N ye mɛn kɛla, i ma wo kɔrɔ lɔn sisen; i ri a ɲayen kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 13:8"/>Piyɛri ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ti n sen makola fewu!» Isa ka a jabi: «Ni n ma i sen mako, lɔnbaya ti ile ni nde tɛma.» <verse eid="JHN 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 13:9"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, wo rɔ n sen kelen tɛ de, kɔni n bolo a ni n kun fanan!» <verse eid="JHN 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 13:10"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni i ra ban i kola, i ma kan ka i ko wo kɔ fo i sen, i fari fan bɛɛ sɛninya le. Aile fanan sɛninya le, kɔni ai bɛɛ tɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 13:11"/>(Baa a ka a lɔn ko mɛn kɛtɔ a janfala, wo le rɔ a ka a fɔ ko: «Ai bɛɛ sɛninyani tɛ.»)<verse eid="JHN 13:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 13:12"/>A ban mɛn kɛla ii sen makola, a ka a la durikiba bila a kan na ka i sii tabali la. Wo rɔ a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai bɛɛ ka a lɔn n ka mɛn kɛ ai la wa? <verse eid="JHN 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 13:13"/>Ai ye n kilila ko karanmɔɔ a ni Maari, ai jɔ le wo rɔ baa n ye wo le ri. <verse eid="JHN 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 13:14"/>Ni n ka ai sen mako, nde ai la Maari a ni ai la karanmɔɔ ri, aile ka kan ka i ɲɔɔn sen mako. <verse eid="JHN 13:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 13:15"/>Ka a masɔrɔn n nɔ misali le yirakala ai la, ai ka kan ka ai kɛ ai jɛrɛ yɛ ɲa mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 13:16"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ ko: jɔn ti se warala a jɔntii ma, kelayala ti warala a talibidenba ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 13:17"/>Ni ai ka ko ɲin lɔn ɲumala, duwawu ye ai yɛ ni ai ka a kɛ.<verse eid="JHN 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 13:18"/>«N tɛ kumala ai bɛɛ yɛ; n ka a lɔn mɛn suwandini n bolo. Kɔni fɔɔ sɛbɛli kuma wo ye dafa ko: ‹Mɔɔ mɛn ye n na buru dɔɔnna, wo tii ri n janfa.› <verse eid="JHN 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 13:19"/>N ye a fɔla ai yɛ sisen sani wo ye kɛ waati mɛn, ni wo sera, ai ri a lemɛniya n ma ko n ye ye. <verse eid="JHN 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 13:20"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ: ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ri sɔn n na karanden dɔ wo ra sɔn nde fanan dɔ, mɛn wa sɔn nde rɔ, wo ra sɔn n kelayaba rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 13:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Janfa ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 13:21"/>A banni wo fɔla, Isa sɔnɔmɛ jalamanna ka a yɛrɛyɛrɛ. A ka a sereya ko: «N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ ko: ai tɛma mɔɔ kelen di n janfa.» <verse eid="JHN 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 13:22"/>A karandenilu ka i ɲɔɔn mafɛnɛ kelen kelen ɲa ma ko a ye kumala yon na ko rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 13:23"/>A la karandenilu tɛma, mɛn duman a yɛ wo tɛrɛ ye Isa tɔrɔfɛ tabali la. <verse eid="JHN 13:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 13:24"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka a ɲa kadɛn a yɛ ko a ni Isa maɲininka a ye kumala mɛn na ko rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 13:25"/>Karanden wo ka a madon Isa la ka a maɲininka a tolo kɔrɔ ko: «Maari, yon de wo tii ri?» <verse eid="JHN 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 13:26"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N di buru kunkundun sun dɔɔnnin muran dɔ, n di wo di mɛn ma, wo le n janfa la.» A banni Isa ka buru kunkundun ta ka a sun ka a di Simɔn Sikariyɔti dencɛ Judasi ma. <verse eid="JHN 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 13:27"/>Judasi ka buru wo sɔrɔn tuma mɛn na, Setana donda a jusu rɔ i kɔrɔ. Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye mɛn kɛla, i ye kaliya kɛla.» <verse eid="JHN 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 13:28"/>Kɔni mɛnilu siini tɛrɛ tabali la, woilu ma a lɔn a ye wo fɔla mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 13:29"/>Ikomin Judasi mɛn tɛrɛ ye wodi lamarala, doilu la miriya ko Isa nɔ a lawala sali dɔɔnninfen san diya le, wala ka wa fen doilu datala misikinanilu la. <verse eid="JHN 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 13:30"/>Judasi ka buru kunkundun ta ka i bɔ ye i kɔrɔkɔrɔ. Su tun da ko.<verse eid="JHN 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Karandenilu ka kan de ka i ɲɔɔn kanin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 13:31"/>A wa mɛn kɛra, Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Sisen, Mɔɔ Dencɛ ka a la gbiliya labɔ, Alla fanan ka a la gbiliya labɔ ale rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 13:32"/>Ni Alla ka a la gbiliya labɔ ale rɔ, Alla fanan di a la gbiliya labɔ a jɛrɛ yɛ, a ri wo kɛ sisen. <verse eid="JHN 13:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 13:33"/>Den mɛsɛnilu n ye ai fɛ waati nin ɲin dɔ. Ai ri n ɲinin, kɔni ikomin n da a fɔ Yahudiyailu yɛ ɲa mɛn ma: ‹N wala yɔrɔ mɛn, ai ti se wala ye.› N ye a fɔla ai fanan yɛ sisen.<verse eid="JHN 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 13:34"/>«N ye jamarili kura le dila ai ma. Ai ye ai ɲɔɔn kanin. Ikomin ai diyara n yɛ ai fanan ye diya ai ɲɔɔn yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 13:35"/>Wo le rɔ bɛɛ ri a lɔn ko n na karandenilu de ai ri, ni ai ka ai ɲɔɔn kanin.»<verse eid="JHN 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 13:36"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, i watɔ mi?» Isa ka a jabi: «N ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, i ti se wala ye sisen, kɔni waati natɔ i ri bila n kɔfɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 13:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 13:37"/>Piyɛri ka a jabi: «Maari, nfenna n ti se bilala i kɔfɛ sisen? N di bɛn saya ma i la ko rɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 13:38"/>Isa ka a jabi: «I ri sa n na ko rɔ wa? N ye tuɲa le fɔla i yɛ ko: sani dondon ye kasi tuma mɛn dɔ i ri a fɔ fewu siɲa sawa ko i ma n lɔn!»<verse eid="JHN 13:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JHN 14"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a ka a fɔ ko ale le ɲenemaya sila ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 14:1"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «Ai jusu kana yɛrɛyɛrɛ. Ai ye lala Alla la, ai ye la nde fanan na. <verse eid="JHN 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 14:2"/>Sii diya siyaman ba le n Fa la bon na. Ni tuɲa tɛ, n di a fɔ ai yɛ, baa n ye wa ka sii diya rabɛn ai yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 14:3"/>N wa sii diya rabɛn ai ma, n di na ka ai ta ka wa an ɲɔɔn fɛ, sani ai ri wa nde ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 14:4"/>Ai ka a lɔn n ye wala sila mɛn kan.»<verse eid="JHN 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 14:5"/>Tomasi ka a fɔ ko: «Maari, an ma a lɔn i ye wala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ. An ye sila wo lɔnna di?» <verse eid="JHN 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 14:6"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Nde, n ye sila le ri, a ni tuɲa, a ni ɲenemaya. Mɔɔ ti se wala Fa ma, ni a ma se nde ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 14:7"/>Ni ai ka n lɔn, ai ri n Fa fanan lɔn. Sisen ai ra a lɔn, ai ra a yen.»<verse eid="JHN 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 14:8"/>Filipe ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Maari, Fa wo yiraka an na, wo ri se an wasala.» <verse eid="JHN 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 14:9"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Filipe, a ra mɛn bakɛ an bɛɛ ye an ɲɔɔn fɛ, kɔni i ma n lɔn wa? Ni mɛn ka n yen, wo ra n Fa yen! Nfenna I ye a fɔla ko ‹Fa yiraka an na›? <verse eid="JHN 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 14:10"/>I ma la a la ko n ye n Fa fɛ, Fa fanan ye n fɛ? N ye kuma mɛn fɔla, wo ti bɔla nde jɛrɛ rɔ de; n Fa mɛn ye nde fɛ wo ye a jɛrɛ la baara kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 14:11"/>Ai ye a la n na, n ye n Fa fɛ, n Fa fanan ye n fɛ, ni wo tɛ ai ye la kɛwaliilu jɛrɛ la sereya la. <verse eid="JHN 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 14:12"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ ko: mɛn ka a lemɛniya la n dɔ wo ri n na baara kabannako fanan kɛ. A ri kabannako kɛ mɛn ka bon ka tamin n ta la ka a masɔrɔn n watɔ n Fa ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 14:13"/>Ai ka foyi maɲininka n tɔɔ rɔ, n di wo kɛ, sa a ri n Fa la gbiliya yiraka nde la, nde mɛn ye a Dencɛ ri. <verse eid="JHN 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 14:14"/>Ni ai ka fen fen maɲininka nde tɔɔ rɔ, n di wo kɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a fɔ ko Nii Sɛniman di na</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 14:15"/>«Ni ai ye n kaninna, ai di n na jamarili mira. <verse eid="JHN 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 14:16"/>Wo rɔ nde ri n Fa madiya, a ni a ri Lalilila gbɛrɛ di ai ma mɛn di to ai fɛ habadan. <verse eid="JHN 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 14:17"/>Lalilila wo ye Nii Sɛniman de ri mɛn ye tuɲa fɔla mɔɔilu yɛ. Dunuɲa mɔɔilu ti se a ko rɔ ka a masɔrɔn a tɛ a yenna, a ma a lɔn. Kɔni ai ka a lɔn, ka a masɔrɔn a ye ai fɛ, a ri kɛ ai sɔnɔmɛ rɔ fanan.<verse eid="JHN 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 14:18"/>«N ti ai bilala ikomin faratanin, kɔni n di n kɔsɛ ai ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 14:19"/>A ti mɛn bakɛ, dunuɲa mɔɔilu ti n yen butun, kɔni ai ri n yen. Ka a masɔrɔn n di ɲenemaya, ai fanan di ɲenemaya. <verse eid="JHN 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 14:20"/>Ni wo lon sera, ai ri a ɲayen ko n ni n Fa ye i ɲɔɔn fɛ ikomin mɔɔ kelen, ko aile ni nde ye i ɲɔɔn fɛ ikomin mɔɔ kelen. <verse eid="JHN 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 14:21"/>Mɔɔ mɛn ye sɔnna n na jamariliilu ma ka ii labato, wo tii le ye n kaninna. Mɔɔ mɛn wa n kanin, n Fa di wo tii kanin. N fanan di a kanin ka n jɛrɛ yiraka a la.»<verse eid="JHN 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 14:22"/>Judasi, kɔni Judasi Sikariyɔti tɛ, wo ka a maɲininka ko: «Maari, nfenna i ri i yiraka an na, kɔni i tɛ i yiraka dunuɲa la wa?» <verse eid="JHN 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 14:23"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni n diyara mɔɔ mɛn yɛ, wo tii ri n kumakan bonya. Wo tii ri diya n Fa fanan yɛ. An di na a ma, an di to a fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 14:24"/>Kɔni ni n ma diya mɛn yɛ, wo ti n kumakan mirala. Ai ye kumakan mɛn namɛnna wo ma bɔ nde rɔ, kɔni n Fa mɛn ka n kelaya.<verse eid="JHN 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 14:25"/>«N ye a bɛɛ fɔla ai yɛ, an ye an ɲɔɔn fɛ waati ɲin dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 14:26"/>Kɔni, Lalilila, Nii Sɛniman, N Fa ye mɛn lanala n tɔɔ rɔ, wo ye ai karanna ko bɛɛ la, aile fanan hankili ri bila a rɔ n ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 14:27"/>«N ye jususuma dila ai ma. Jususuma mɛn ye n na, n ye wo ɲɔɔn dila ai ma. N tɛ ai dila ikomin dunuɲa ye a dila ɲa mɛn ma. Ai jusu kana yɛrɛyɛrɛ, ai jusu kana bɔ ka silan. <verse eid="JHN 14:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 14:28"/>Ai ra a mɛn ko n ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ ko: ‹N watɔ, n di n kɔsɛ ai ma fanan›. Ni n diyara ai yɛ ai tun di sɛwa, baa n watɔ n Fa ma, n Fa mɛn ka bon nde ma. <verse eid="JHN 14:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 14:29"/>Nba, n ka wo fɔ ai yɛ sisen sani a ye kɛ, sa a wa kɛ tuma mɛn na, ai ri lemɛniya. <verse eid="JHN 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 14:30"/>N ti kumala ai yɛ bakɛ wo kɔ, baa dunuɲa mansaden ye nala. A ti se nde la, <verse eid="JHN 14:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 14:31"/>kɔni n Fa ka mɛn jamari n yɛ, n ye wo le labatola, sa dunuɲa mɔɔilu ri a lɔn ko n ye n Fa kaninna. Ai ye ai wuli, an ye bɔ yan.»<verse eid="JHN 14:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JHN 15"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a fɔ ko ale le rɛsɛn nɔnbɔju ri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 15:1"/>«N ye rɛsɛn nɔnbɔju ɲuma le ri, n Fa le sɛnɛla ri. <verse eid="JHN 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 15:2"/>Bolon bolon ye n na, ni wo ma den kɛ a la, a ri a tɛɛ. Bolon bolon wa den kɛ a la, a ri wo matɛɛ sa a ri den siyaman kɛ ka tamin fɔlɔman kan. <verse eid="JHN 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 15:3"/>Aile le ra lasɛninya kelen ka fara n na kuma la. <verse eid="JHN 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 15:4"/>Ai ye sidini to n ma, ikomin n fanan ye sidini tola ai ma. Ikomin nɔnbɔbolon ti a den kɛla a jɛrɛ ma, ni a ti nɔnbɔju le la, wo ɲa kelen na aile fanan ti se ai denna ai jɛrɛ yɛ ni aile tɛ sidini to nde ma.<verse eid="JHN 15:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 15:5"/>«N ye nɔnbɔju le ri, ai ye nɔnbɔbolon de. Mɛn wa sidini to n ma, a ni nde wa sidini to a ma, wo ri a den bakɛ la, baa ni nde tɛ, ai ti se foyi kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 15:6"/>Ni mɔɔ mɔɔ ma sidini to n ma woilu tii ri fili kɔma ikomin nɔnbɔbolon wa a tɛɛla, woilu ri ja ɲa mɛn ma. Wo bolonilu ri matɔmɔ ka bila ta rɔ ka janni. <verse eid="JHN 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 15:7"/>Kɔni ni aile ye sidini tola n ma, a ni n kumakan fanan ye sidini tola ai ma, ai ri fen fen maɲininka n tɔɔ rɔ, bɛɛ ri kɛ ai yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 15:8"/>Ko mɛn ye N Fa gbiliyala, ai wa den siyaman ba kɛla ka wo yiraka wo rɔ ai ye n na karandenilu ri.<verse eid="JHN 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 15:9"/>«Ikomin n Fa Alla ye n kaninna ɲa mɛn ma, nde fanan da ai kanin wo ɲa ma. Ai ye to n na kaninteya rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 15:10"/>Ni ai ka n na jamarili bonya, ai ye tola n na kaninteya rɔ, ikomin nde fanan ye n Fa la jamarili bonyala, n ye a la diyaɲɛ wo le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 15:11"/>N tɛrɛ ra wo bɛɛ ɲafɔ, ko sɛwa mɛn ye n na, sa wo ɲɔɔn di kɛ ai la, ai la sɛwa ri kɛ sɛwa dafanin di. <verse eid="JHN 15:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 15:12"/>N na jamarili ye mɛn di: ai ye diya ai ɲɔɔn yɛ ikomin ai ye diyani n yɛ ɲa mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 15:13"/>Mɔɔ mɛn ka a nii di ka sa a duɲɔɔ kosɔn kaninteya si ti tamin wo la. <verse eid="JHN 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 15:14"/>Ai ye n duɲɔɔ le ri, ni ai ka n na jamarili kɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 15:15"/>N tɛ ai kilila butun ko n na baaraden, ka a masɔrɔn baaraden ma a lɔn baaratii ye mɛn kɛla. N ye ai kilila le ko n duɲɔɔ ka a masɔrɔn n Fa ka n karan fen fen, n ka ai lalɔnni wo bɛɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 15:16"/>Aile ma n suwandi, kɔni nde ka ai suwandi. N da aile lɔ kelala ka wa a den, den mɛn di mɛn a la, kosa n Fa ri sɔn ai ma a wa foyi maɲininka n tɔɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 15:17"/>N ye jamarili ɲinilu dila ai ma kosa ai ri i ɲɔɔn kanin.<verse eid="JHN 15:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Karandenilu ri gboya dunuɲa yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 15:18"/>«Ni ai gboyara dunuɲa yɛ ai ye a lɔn ko nde le fɔlɔ gboyara a yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 15:19"/>Ni ai ni dunuɲa ye kelen de ri, ai ri diya dunuɲa yɛ, baa ai ye dunuɲa ta le ri. Kɔni, ka a masɔrɔn ai tɛ dunuɲa ta ri, a ni n ka ai suwandi dunuɲa tɛma, wo le rɔ ai gboyara dunuɲa yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 15:20"/>Ai ye hankili bila n ka mɛn fɔ ai yɛ ko: ‹Baaraden ma wara a baaratii ri›. Ni ii ka n tɔrɔ, ii ri ai fanan tɔrɔya. Ni ii ka n kumakan namɛn ka a lamara, ii ri ai la kumakan namɛn ka a lamara. <verse eid="JHN 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 15:21"/>Kɔni, ko wo bɛɛ ye kɛla ai la n tɔɔ la ko le rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn mɛn ka n kelaya, ii ma wo lɔn. <verse eid="JHN 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 15:22"/>Ni n tɛrɛ ma na a ni n ma kuma, julumun tɛrɛ ti ii yɛ. Kɔni sisen, julumun ye ii yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 15:23"/>Mɔɔ mɛn ye nde nagboyaɲɛla, wo tii ra n Fa Alla fanan nagboyaɲɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 15:24"/>Ni n ma kabannakoilu baara kɛ ii ɲana mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ma se mɛn ɲɔɔn kɛla, julumun tɛrɛ tɛ ii ma wo rɔ. Sisen ii ka a yen, kɔni n ni n Fa gboyara ii yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 15:25"/>Wo rɔ, kumakan mɛn sɛbɛni ii la sariya la, wo ri a dafa: ‹N gboyara ii yɛ, kun ti a la.› <verse eid="JHN 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 15:26"/>Awa Lalilila le wa na waati mɛn na n Fa ta fan dɔ, Nii Sɛniman, tuɲa tii, mɛn ye bɔ n Fa rɔ, a ri n na sereya bɔ. <verse eid="JHN 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 15:27"/>Aile fanan di kɛ n na sereya ri, baa an da mɛn i ɲɔɔn fɛ kɛbi n na baara damira waati.»<verse eid="JHN 15:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JHN 16"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 16:1"/>Isa ka a fɔ ko: «N da wo bɛɛ ɲafɔ ai yɛ sa ai kana lafili. <verse eid="JHN 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 16:2"/>Ii ri aile gbɛn salibon kɔndɔ, wo fanan waati natɔ sela mɔɔ mɛn ye ai faa ko rɔ, wo tii mirini ko a ye Alla le batola wo ɲa ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 16:3"/>Ii ri woilu kɛ ka a masɔrɔn ii ma n Fa lɔn, wala nde jɛrɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 16:4"/>N ye wo fɔla ai yɛ, sa woilu wa se, ai hankili ri bila a rɔ ko n ka a fɔ le ai yɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 16:4">«N ma wo fɔ ai yɛ a damirala, ka a masɔrɔn n tɛrɛ ye ai tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 16:5"/>Sisen, n watɔla le wo ma mɛn ka n kelaya, kɔni ai kelen ma n maɲininka ko: ‹I watɔ mi?› <verse eid="JHN 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 16:6"/>Ai jusumakasini kojuuya ko ɲinilu kosɔn, n nɔ mɛnilu fɔla ai yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 16:7"/>Kɔni n ye tuɲa fɔla ai yɛ ko: ai la hɛrɛ le a rɔ ni n wara, baa ni n ma wa, Lalilila ti nala ai ma. Kɔni ni n wara n di a lawa ai ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 16:8"/>Wo wa na, a ri julumun ko ni telenbaya ko ni kiti tɛɛ ko gbɛ dunuɲa yɛ, ka a yiraka ii la ko ii filini woilu bɛɛ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 16:9"/>Ii filini julumun ko rɔ ka a masɔrɔn ii ma lemɛniya nde ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 16:10"/>Ii filini telenbaya ko rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn n watɔ n Fa ma, a ni ai ti n yenna butun. <verse eid="JHN 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 16:11"/>Ii filini kiti tɛɛ ko rɔ, ka a masɔrɔn, dunuɲa ɲin kuntii a ra jalaki.<verse eid="JHN 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 16:12"/>«Kuma siyaman de n bolo ka a fɔ ai yɛ, kɔni ai ti se wo kɔrɔ sisen. <verse eid="JHN 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 16:13"/>Nii Sɛnimanna Tuɲa wa na tuma mɛn na wo ye ai taala tuɲa le rɔ, baa a sa kumala a jɛrɛ yɛ ɲa wo ma, kɔni a wa fen fen mɛn a ri wo fɔ. Ko mɛn ye nala a ri wo ɲafɔ ai yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 16:14"/>A ri n na gbiliya yiraka, baa mɛn tɛrɛ ye nde rɔ a ri wo ta ka a lase ai ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 16:15"/>Fen fen mɛn ye n Fa bolo a bɛɛ ye n ta le ri. Wo le kosɔn n da a fɔ ai yɛ ko mɛn tɛrɛ ye n dɔ Nii Sɛniman di wo ta ka a fɔ ai yɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 16:16"/>Sani waati ai ti n yenna butun, waati wo wa tamin a ti mɛn bakɛ ai ri n yen fanan.»<verse eid="JHN 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 16:17"/>A la karandenilu tɛma ii tɛrɛ ye i ɲɔɔn maɲininkala ko: «A ye nfen fɔ ko rɔ an yɛ ko: ‹Sani waati ai ti n yenna butun, waati wo wa tamin a ti mɛn bakɛ ai ri n yen fanan›? A ni fanan ‹ka a masɔrɔn n watɔ n Fa ma›?» <verse eid="JHN 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 16:18"/>Ii ye a fɔla ikɔ tuunni ko: «A ye nfen fɔla ko: ‹Waati dando›? An ma a lɔn a ye mɛn fɔla.»<verse eid="JHN 16:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 16:19"/>Isa ka a lɔn ko ii ye a fɛ ka a maɲininka, a ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye i ɲɔɔn maɲininkala ko n ye nfen fɔla kuma ɲin dɔ ko: ‹Sani waati ai ti n yenna butun, waati wo wa tamin a ti mɛn bakɛ ai ri n yen fanan›? <verse eid="JHN 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 16:20"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ ko: ai ri kasi a ni ka kule, ka a tɛrɛn dunuɲa mɔɔilu ri sɛwa bakɛ ka ɲaalen. Ai ri to jusukasi rɔ, kɔni ai la jusukasi wo ri yɛlɛman ka a kɛ sɛwa ba ri, fo ka ɲaalen. <verse eid="JHN 16:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 16:21"/>Ni muso kɛra tin ma a jusukasini, ka a masɔrɔn dimin ye a kan, kɔni ni a wa den sɔrɔn a ri sɛwa ka ɲina a la tɔrɔyaba wo kɔ, baa adamaden sɔrɔnda dunuɲa rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 16:22"/>Wo ɲa kelen de ma, ai mɛn fanan jusukasini sisen, kɔni n di ai yen kokura, ai jusu ri sɛwa. Sawani mɛn ye wo ri, mɔɔ si ti se wo bɔla ai bolo. <verse eid="JHN 16:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 16:23"/>Wo lon wo rɔ ai ti n maɲininkala foyi la. N ye tuɲa le fɔla ai yɛ ko: ai wa foyi maɲininka n tɔɔ rɔ n Fa yɛ, a ri wo bɛɛ di i ma. <verse eid="JHN 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 16:24"/>Haan bi ai ma foyi maɲininka n tɔɔ rɔ. Ai ye a maɲininka, ai ri a sɔrɔn, sani ai la sɛwa ye dafa.<verse eid="JHN 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 16:25"/>«N ka ɲin bɛɛ fɔ ai yɛ kuma kɔrɔlama le rɔ. Waati natɔ sela n ti sɔn kuma kɔrɔlama si fɔla ai yɛ butun, kɔni n di n Fa la ko bɛɛ fɔ ai yɛ gbɛ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 16:26"/>Wo lon ai ri maɲininka n tɔɔ la, n ma a fɔ ko n di n Fa madiya ai ta fan dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 16:27"/>Hen! Ai duman n Fa jɛrɛ yɛ ka a masɔrɔn n diyara ai yɛ, a ni ai lara a la ko n bɔni Alla le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 16:28"/>N bɔni n Fa le rɔ ka na dunuɲa rɔ, sisen n bɔtɔ dunuɲa rɔ ka wa n Fa ma.»<verse eid="JHN 16:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 16:29"/>A la karandenilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «A mafɛnɛ, sisen i ye kumala gbɛ rɔ, i ti foyi fɔla kuma kɔrɔlama rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 16:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 16:30"/>Sisen an ka a lɔn ko i ka ko bɛɛ lɔn a ni i mako sa a la mɔɔ ni i maɲininka fosi la. Wo le rɔ an ka lemɛniya a la ko i bɔni Alla le rɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 16:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 16:31"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ai ye lemɛniyala sisen wa? <verse eid="JHN 16:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 16:32"/>Waati natɔ sela, a don gbun da se, ai ri jɛnsɛn ai ɲɔɔn na bɛɛ ri wa a wara. Ai ri n kelen to. Kɔni n kelen tɛ, baa n Fa ye n tɔrɔfɛ. <verse eid="JHN 16:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 16:33"/>N da ko ɲinilu fɔ ai yɛ, sa ai jusu ri suma sɔrɔn n na ko rɔ. Ai ri tɔrɔya sɔrɔn dunuɲa rɔ, kɔni ai ye sɛɛbɛ don, baa nde ra se dunuɲa la.»<verse eid="JHN 16:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JHN 17"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Alla matara a la mɔɔilu yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 17:1"/>A banni kuma wo fɔla, Isa ka a ɲakɔrɔta sankolo ma ka a fɔ ko: «N Fa, waati ra se. I ye i Dencɛ la gbiliya yiraka mɔɔilu la, sani i Dencɛ fanan di i la gbiliya yirika ii yɛ, <verse eid="JHN 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 17:2"/>ka a masɔrɔn i ka se di a ma fɔlɔ adamaden bɛɛ ko sani a ri ɲenemaya banbali di mɔɔ bɛɛ ma, i ka mɛn di a ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 17:3"/>Wo rɔ ɲenemaya banbali ye mɛn di, wo le ɲin: ka ile lɔn, ile mɛn kelen pe ye Alla jɛrɛjɛrɛ ri, a ni ka Isa Ɲenematɔmɔnin fanan lɔn, i ka mɛn kelaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 17:4"/>N da i la gbiliya yiraka mɔɔilu la duukolo kan, baa i ka n lɔ baara mɛn na, n da ban wo la. <verse eid="JHN 17:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 17:5"/>N Fa, gbiliya mɛn tɛrɛ ye n na i dafɛ sani dunuɲa ye dan, i ye wo di n ma sisen i dafɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 17:6"/>«N da i tɔɔ yiraka mɔɔilu la i ka mɛn suwandi dunuɲa rɔ ka ii di n ma. Ii tɛrɛ ye i ta le ri, kɔni i ka ii di n ma. Ii ka i la kuma labato. <verse eid="JHN 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 17:7"/>Sisen ii ka a lɔn ko i ka foyi di n ma a bɛɛ bɔni ile le rɔ, <verse eid="JHN 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 17:8"/>baa n ka kuma lase ii ma i ka mɛn fɔ n yɛ. Ii ka kuma wo masɔrɔn, ii ra a lɔn ko n bɔni ile le rɔ a ni ii ka la a la ko ile le ka n kelaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 17:9"/>N ye i madiyala woilu le ta fan dɔ. N tɛ i madiyala dunuɲa ta fan dɔ, kɔni i ka mɛnilu di n ma, ka a masɔrɔn ii ye i ta le ri. <verse eid="JHN 17:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 17:10"/>Fen fen ye n ta ri wo fanan ye i ta le ri. Fen fen ye i ta ri, wo fanan ye n ta le ri. N ye gbiliyala woilu le rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 17:11"/>N tɛ dunuɲa rɔ butun, kɔni ii ye dunuɲa rɔ, nde natɔ i ma. Fa Sɛniman, i ye ii lamara i tɔɔ sɛniman na, i ka tɔɔ mɛn di n ma, sa ii ye kɛ kelen de ikomin an ye kelen di ɲa mɛn ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 17:12"/>Ka n to ii dafɛ, n ka ii lakandan i la sebaya la, sebaya mɛn ye i tɔɔ rɔ, i ka tɔɔ mɛn di n ma. N ka n janto ii rɔ. Wo rɔ, ii si ma tunun, fo halaki latɛɛra mɛn ma. Wo tununda sa i la kuma ri dafa, mɛn sɛbɛni kitabu sɛniman kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 17:13"/>Sisen, n natɔ i ma; n ye kumala dunuɲa rɔ, sani n na sɛwa ba ɲɔɔn di kɛ ii la fɔɔ ka kɛ sɛwa dafani ri. <verse eid="JHN 17:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 17:14"/>N ka i la kumakan di ii ma. Wo rɔ ii gboyara dunuɲa yɛ, ka a masɔrɔn ii tɛ dunuɲa ta ri, ikomin nde tɛ dunuɲa ta ri de. <verse eid="JHN 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 17:15"/>N tɛ i madiyala ko i ye ii bɔ dunuɲa rɔ, kɔni i ye ii kanda Ko Juu Tii ma. <verse eid="JHN 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 17:16"/>Ii sa dunuɲa ta ikomin nde sa dunuɲa ta ɲa mɛn dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 17:17"/>Ii bila a dan na i jɛrɛ ma ka fara i la tuɲa la, i la kuma, mɛn ye tuɲa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 17:18"/>Ikomin i ka n kelaya dunuɲa rɔ, nde fanan da ii kelaya dunuɲa rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 17:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 17:19"/>N ye n jɛrɛ bilala a dan na i yɛ ii kosɔn, sa ii fanan di bila a dan na bɛrɛbɛrɛ kɛ i yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 17:20"/>«N tɛ i matarala ii kelen ta fan dɔ, kɔni ni mɛn lemɛniyara nde ma ii la sereya rɔ, <verse eid="JHN 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 17:21"/>sani bɛɛ ye kɛ kelen di. N Fa, ikomin ile ni nde ye kelen di, woilu fanan ni ande bɛɛ ye kɛ kelen di, sani dunuɲa ye a lɔn ko ile le ka n kelaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 17:22"/>Nde, n ka gbiliya di ii ma i ka mɛn di n ma, sani ii kɛ kelen di, ikomin nde ni ile, <verse eid="JHN 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 17:23"/>nde ni iele ye kelen di, sani ii ri kɛ kelen de ri, a ni dunuɲa ri a lɔn ko ile le ka n kelaya a ni ii duman i yɛ fanan, ikomin nde duman ile yɛ ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="JHN 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 17:24"/>«N Fa, n ye a fɛ ko n ye yɔrɔ mɛn na, i ka mɛnilu di n ma, woilu ni nde ye kɛ ye, sa ii ri n na gbiliya yen, i ka gbiliya mɛn di n ma, ka a masɔrɔn n duman i yɛ sani dunuɲa damira waati. <verse eid="JHN 17:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 17:25"/>N Fa, mɛn telenni, dunuɲa ma i lɔn, kɔni nde ka i lɔn, woilu fanan ye a lɔn ko ile le ka n kelaya. <verse eid="JHN 17:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 17:26"/>I ye ɲa mɛn ma, n da wo yiraka ii la. N di to wo yirakala fanan sa ii di mɔɔilu kanin ikomin i ra nde kanin ɲa mɛn ma, a ni n sidini ri kɛ ii ma.»<verse eid="JHN 17:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JHN 18"/>
  <para style="s">Isa lalɔ ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 18:1"/>A banni wo fɔla, Isa ni a la karandenilu bɔra ka wa Kidirɔn Dinban tɛɛ ka wa a fan kelen ma. A ni a la karandenilu donda jiritu do kɔndɔ ye. <verse eid="JHN 18:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 18:2"/>Judasi, mɛn di a janfa, wo ka yɔrɔ wo lɔn, ka a masɔrɔn Isa ni a la karandenilu tɛrɛ ye ii ladɛnna waati siyaman na. <verse eid="JHN 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 18:3"/>Judasi kɛra kɛlɛden la kuntii ri Isa lalɔ ko rɔ, a ni doilu mɛn kelayani Alla la sarakalaselailu ni Farisilu bolo, ii sera jiritu wo rɔ fitinna ye ii bolo a ni kalamɛlɛn a ni kɛlɛkɛfenilu.<verse eid="JHN 18:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 18:4"/>Isa, mɛn ka a lɔn ko mɛn bɛɛ ye nala a masɔrɔnna, a ka a madon ii la ka ii maɲininka ko: «Ai ye yon de ɲininna?» <verse eid="JHN 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 18:5"/>Ii ka a jabi: «An ye Isa Nasarɛtika le ɲininna.» A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nde le.» Judasi, mɛn ka janfa don a ma, a lɔni tɛrɛ ii dafɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 18:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 18:6"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ waati mɛn dɔ ko: «Nde le,» ii ka sɛ kɔtɔma, ka be duu ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 18:7"/>Isa ka ii maɲininka kokura ko: «Ai ye yon ɲininna?» Ii ka a fɔ ko: «Isa, Nasarɛtika.» <verse eid="JHN 18:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 18:8"/>Isa ka ii jabi: «N da a fɔ ai yɛ ko nde le. Ni ai ye nde le ɲininna, ai ye do ɲinilu to ye.» <verse eid="JHN 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 18:9"/>A tɛrɛ ye kumala ka kuma wo dafa a tɛrɛ ka mɛn fɔ kɔrɔman na ko: «I ka mɔɔ mɛnilu di n ma, wo si ma tunun n bolo.»<verse eid="JHN 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 18:10"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka fanmuru ta ka sarakalasela la jɔn do bolokininma tolo tɛɛ a la. Jɔn wo tɛrɛ tɔɔ le ko Malikusi. <verse eid="JHN 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 18:11"/>Isa ka a fɔ Piyɛri ma ko: «I la fanmuru don a laa rɔ. N Fa ka tɔrɔya mɛn natɛɛ n ma, n di n ban wo rɔ wa?»<verse eid="JHN 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 18:12"/>Kɛlɛdenlu a ni ii la kuntii, a ni Alla la sarakalaselailu kandanilailu ka Isa mira ka a sidi. <verse eid="JHN 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 18:13"/>Ii nara a ri fɔlɔ Anasi wara, baa Kayifasi mɛn ye sarakalasela kuntiiya la san wo la, wo birancɛ le. <verse eid="JHN 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 18:14"/>Kayifasi le ka Yahudiyailu lalili ko: a bɛnni mɔɔ kelen ye faa jama nɔ rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ ko a ma Isa lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 18:15"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ni karanden do bilara ii kɔ. Karanden wo ka sarakalasela kuntii lɔn, a donda sarakalasela la lu ma Isa kɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 18:16"/>Kɔnin Piyɛri ma don. A tora lu da la. Karanden do wo bɔra lu ma, a kumara lu da kɔnɔgbɛnna yɛ, ka Piyɛri ladon. <verse eid="JHN 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 18:17"/>Muso mɛn ye da kɔnɔgbɛnna wo ka Piyɛri maɲininka ko: «Ile, i fanan ye a la karanden do le di?» A ka a fɔ ko: «Nde tɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 18:18"/>Baaradenilu a ni lakandanilailu ka ta bila sinkɔn dɔ ka ii maja ta dafɛ, baa nɛnɛ tɛrɛ ye bɔla. Piyɛri fanan tɛrɛ ye woilu tɔrɔfɛ ka a maja ye.<verse eid="JHN 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 18:19"/>Fan kelen ma, Alla la sarakalasela kuntii ka Isa maɲininka a la karandenilu ma a ni a karan ɲa ma. <verse eid="JHN 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 18:20"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N kumara gbɛ le rɔ mɔɔ bɛɛ yɛ, n ka mɔɔilu karan salibonilu la a ni Allabatobonba jin kɔndɔ, Yahudiya bɛɛ ladɛnnin tɛrɛ ye. N ma foyi fɔ gbundu rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 18:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 18:21"/>Nfenna i ye n maɲininkala? I ye maɲininka mɛn ka ii tolo malɔ n na, n ka mɛn fɔ ii yɛ; ii ka a lɔn n ye mɛn fɔla ii yɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 18:22"/>Kuma wo rɔ lakandalila do, mɛn lɔni tɛrɛ ye, ka a da gbasi ka a fɔ ko: «I ye sarakalasela kuntii le jabila ɲa wo le ma?» <verse eid="JHN 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 18:23"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni n ka kuma juu le fɔ, kuma juu wo yiraka, kɔni n ka kuma mɛn fɔ ni a tuɲa le, nfenna i ye n gbasila?» <verse eid="JHN 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 18:24"/>Wo rɔ Anasi ka Isa sidini madon sarakalasela kuntii Kayifasi la.<verse eid="JHN 18:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Piyɛri ka a fɔ fanan ko a ma Isa lɔn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 18:25"/>Simɔn Piyɛri tora a majala ta dafɛ. Mɔɔ do ka a fɔ a ma ko: «Ile fanan, i ye a la karandenilu do le ri wa?» Kɔni Piyɛri ka a jɛrɛ dakan ko: «Nde tɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 18:26"/>Sarakalasela la jɔn mɛn tolo tɛɛla a la Piyɛri bolo wo la mɔɔ do ka a fɔ ko: «N ka i yen de a kɔfɛ jiritu rɔ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 18:27"/>Kɔni Piyɛri ka a jɛrɛ dakan kokura, i kɔrɔkɔrɔ dondon kasira.<verse eid="JHN 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ii wara Isa ri Pilate wara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 18:28"/>Ii nara ka bɔ Kayifasi wara ka wa mara kunnasiila la mansaya bon na. Sɔɔma da le tɛrɛ. Mɛnilu wara Isa ri, ii ma don mansa bon na sa ii kana ii la sɛninya landa tiɲan. Wo wa kɛ ii ti se Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnnin kɛla. <verse eid="JHN 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 18:29"/>Wo rɔ, Pilate bɔra ka wa ii ma ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye tɔɔ su ɲuman de lala cɛɛ ɲin na?» <verse eid="JHN 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 18:30"/>Ii ka a jabi: «Ni kojuu kɛla tɛ an tɛrɛ tɛ a mirala ka na a ri i ma.»<verse eid="JHN 18:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 18:31"/>Pilate ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye a mira ka a kiti tɛɛ ai la sariya la.» Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An tɛ kiti tɛɛla ri ka mɔɔ faa.» <verse eid="JHN 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 18:32"/>Isa tɛrɛ ra a la saya ko kuma wo lase, a la saya ko ye dafala ɲa mɛn ma.<verse eid="JHN 18:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 18:33"/>Pilate donda mansa bon kɔndɔ, ka Isa kili ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye Yahudiyailu la mansa le ri?» <verse eid="JHN 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 18:34"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ile le ka wo fɔ, wala mɔɔ gbɛrɛ le ka wo fɔ n na ko rɔ wa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 18:35"/>Pilate ka a jabi: «Nde, Yahudiya le di? I la jama ni sarakalasela kuntiilu ka i don n bolo. I ra nfen kɛ?»<verse eid="JHN 18:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 18:36"/>Isa ka a jabi: «N na mansaya bɔni yɔrɔ gbɛrɛ le ka na. A ma bɔ dunuɲa rɔ yan. Ni wo tɛ, n kɔmɔɔilu tun di Yahudiyailu la ɲɛmɔɔilu kɛlɛ, sa n kana don woilu bolo. N na mansaya ma bɔ dunuɲa ɲin dɔ, fo yɔrɔ gbɛrɛ.» <verse eid="JHN 18:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 18:37"/>Pilate ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye mansa le ri!» Isa ka a jabi: «I jɛrɛ le ka a fɔ ko n ye mansa le ri. Ni n da sɔrɔn a ni n da na dunuɲa rɔ, n nani kɛla tuɲa la sereya le ri. Mɔɔ mɔɔ mɛn ye tuɲa ta le ri, wo ri n kumakan namɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 18:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 18:38"/>Pilate ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Tuɲa ye nfen di?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 18:38">A banni wo fɔla, ale bɔra kokura ka wa Yahudiyailu ma ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nde ma cɛɛ ɲin mira kun kelen lɔn mɛn di kɛ a faa ko ri. <verse eid="JHN 18:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 18:39"/>Kɔni ka bɛn ai la namun ma san san Taminkunna Sali wa se n di kasoden kelen bila; ai ye a fɛ n ye Yahudiyailu la mansa bila wa?» <verse eid="JHN 18:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 18:40"/>Ii ka a jabi mankan ba rɔ ko: «Ale tɛ, Barabasi bila!» Awa Barabasi tɛrɛ ye mɔɔ murantiini le ri.<verse eid="JHN 18:40"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JHN 19"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 19:1"/>Wo rɔ Pilate ka Isa don kɛlɛden bolo ka a gbasi biɲɛ la. <verse eid="JHN 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 19:2"/>Kɛlɛden ka nɔnbɔ wɔninnama ta ka a mɔrɔmɔrɔ i ɲɔɔn ma ka a kɛ mansa fula munuɲa do ri ka wo birin a kun na, a ni ii ka durukiba wulenman ɲalagbɛ do bila a kan na. <verse eid="JHN 19:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 19:3"/>Ii tora ii madonna a la ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Yahudiyailu la mansa, i ni kɛ!» Ii tora a da gbasila.<verse eid="JHN 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 19:4"/>Pilate bɔra kokura ka a fɔ Yahudiyailu yɛ ko: «Ai ɲa lɔ! N da na a ri ai ma, sa ai ri a lɔn ko n ma kojuu si yen cɛɛ ɲin ma mɛn di kɛ a faa ko ri.» <verse eid="JHN 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 19:5"/>Isa bɔra kɛnɛma. Nɔnbɔ wɔninnama mansa fula birinni a kun na, durukiba wulenman ɲalagbɛ ye a kan na. Pilate ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ɲa lɔ! Cɛɛ ye yan!» <verse eid="JHN 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 19:6"/>Ii ka a yen mɛn kɛ sarakalasela kuntiilu a ni lakandanilailu ka wɔyɔwɔyɔ kɛ: «Ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan! Ka a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan!» Pilate ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Aile ye a ta aile jɛrɛ yɛ, ai ye a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan, baa nde ma sariya yen mɛn di kɛ a faa ko ri.» <verse eid="JHN 19:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 19:7"/>Yahudiyailu ka a jabi: «Sariya kelen ye an bolo wo le a faa ko ri a don ka kan de ka a faa, ka a masɔrɔn a ka a fɔ ko a ye Alla dencɛ ri.»<verse eid="JHN 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 19:8"/>Pilate ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, do lara a silan kan. <verse eid="JHN 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 19:9"/>A donda a la mansa bon na ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «I bɔni mi?» Kɔni Isa ma a jabi. <verse eid="JHN 19:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 19:10"/>Pilate ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ti kumala nde yɛ? I ma a lɔn ko se ye n bolo ka i bila? Se ye n na ka i gbɔngbɔn jiri kan fanan?» <verse eid="JHN 19:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 19:11"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Se foyi tɛ i yɛ n kan fo mɛn bɔni Alla bolo. Wo le rɔ, mɛn ka n don i bolo, wo la kojuu ka bon i ta ri.»<verse eid="JHN 19:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 19:12"/>Pilate ka wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, a ka Isa bila ɲa ɲinin, kɔni Yahudiyailu ka ii mankan ba labɔ ko: «Ni i ka a bila, i ti Sesare duɲɔɔ di. Baa mɔɔ mɛn wa a jɛrɛ kɛ mansa ri, wo tii muruntini Sesari kanma.» <verse eid="JHN 19:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 19:13"/>A ka kuma wo mɛn tuma mɛn na, Pilate bɔra Isa ri gbɛ ma ka wa a jɛrɛ sii kiti diya, yɔrɔ wo tɔɔ le ko Kabakuru Yɔrɔ, Heburu kan dɔ ko Kabata. <verse eid="JHN 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 19:14"/>Taminkunna Sali dɔɔnninta rabɛn lon de tɛrɛ, teletala, Pilate ka a fɔ Yahudiyailu yɛ ko: «I ɲa lɔ! Ai la mansa ye yan!» <verse eid="JHN 19:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 19:15"/>Kɔni ii ka ii mankan nabɔ ko: «Ka a faa! Ka a faa! A ye a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan!» Pilate ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Nde ye ai la mansa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan wa?» Sarakalasela kuntiilu ka a jabi: «Mansa si tɛ an kun na fo mansaba Sesari.» <verse eid="JHN 19:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 19:16"/>Wo rɔ Pilate ka Isa bila ii bolo a gbɔngbɔn jiri kan kanma.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="JHN 19:16">Isa gbɔngbɔnda jiri kan</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JHN 19:16">Wo rɔ ii ka Isa mira. <verse eid="JHN 19:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 19:17"/>A jɛrɛ ka gbɔngbɔn jiri ta, ka wa a ri yɔrɔ mɛn tɔɔ ko Kunkolo. Heburu kan dɔ ii ye a fɔla yɔrɔ wo ma ko Kɔlikota. <verse eid="JHN 19:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 19:18"/>Ii ye a gbɔngbɔnna jiri kan ye le, a ni mɔɔ fila, do ye a bolokininma do ye a bolomaran ma; Isa ye ii tɛma. <verse eid="JHN 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 19:19"/>Pilate ka sɛbɛli kɛ ka wo gbɔngbɔn Isa gbɔngbɔn jiri kan. A tɛrɛ sɛbɛni ko: «Isa Nasarɛtika, Yahudiyailu la mansa.» <verse eid="JHN 19:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 19:20"/>Yahudiyailu siyaman ba le ka sɛbɛ wo karan, ka a masɔrɔn Isa gbɔngbɔnni jiri kan yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ wo ni so tɛma ma jan. Sɛbɛli tɛrɛ ye Heburu kan dɔ, a ni Rɔmu kan dɔ, a ni fanan Kirɛki kan dɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 19:21"/>Sarakalasela kuntiilu ka a fɔ Pilate yɛ ko: «I kana sɛbɛ ko: ‹Yahudiyailu la mansa›, kɔni ‹A ka a fɔ ko: Nde ye Yahudiyailu la mansa ri.›» <verse eid="JHN 19:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 19:22"/>Pilate ka a jabi: «N ka mɛn sɛbɛ, n da ban a sɛbɛla.»<verse eid="JHN 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 19:23"/>Kɛlɛden ii ban mɛn kɛra Isa gbɔngbɔnna jiri kan, ka a la faanin ta, ii ka wo ratala sidiyama naanin, kɛlɛden bɛɛ ni a ta fan. Ii ka a duruki kɔrɔbila fanan ta. Duruki kɔrɔbila wo karasila tɛrɛ sa a la, ka a bɔ a sanma fɔɔ a duuma. <verse eid="JHN 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 19:24"/>Ii ka a fɔ i ɲɔɔn yɛ ko: «An kana a rafara, kɔni an ye kalabe kɛ, kala wa mɛn mira wo ri a sɔrɔn.» Wo rɔ sɛbɛli kuma wo ra dafa: «Ii ra n na faanin ratala i ɲɔɔn na, ii ra kalabe kɛ n na faanin ɲuma la ko rɔ.» Awa kɛlɛdenlu ka wo le kɛ.<verse eid="JHN 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 19:25"/>Isa la gbɔngbɔn jiri tɔrɔfɛ a na ni a na kɔrɔmuso tɛrɛ ye ye, a ni Kɔlɔpasi la muso Mariyamu a ni Mariyamu Makidalaka. <verse eid="JHN 19:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 19:26"/>Isa la karanden mɛn duman a yɛ kosɛbɛ, wo lɔni tɛrɛ Isa na dafɛ ye. Isa ka wo fila yen tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ a na yɛ ko: «Muso, i ɲa lɔ, i dencɛ ye ɲin di.» <verse eid="JHN 19:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 19:27"/>A ka a fɔ a karanden fanan yɛ ko: «I ɲa lɔ, i na le ɲin di!» Waati kelen wo rɔ karanden wo ka Isa na ta ka wa a ri a la lu ma.<verse eid="JHN 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa sa ɲa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 19:28"/>Wo taminnin kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a lɔn ko ko bɛɛ ra dafa, a ka a fɔ sani sɛbɛli kuma wo ye dafa, ko: «Ji lɔɔ ye n na.» <verse eid="JHN 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 19:29"/>Ji fɔrɔkɔ do tɛrɛ ye, fani rɛsɛnji kumunni. Do ka fuu ta ka a sun rɛsɛnji wo rɔ ka a sidi hisope jiri bolon do la ka a madon a da la. <verse eid="JHN 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 19:30"/>Isa ka rɛsɛnji kumunni wo sɔrɔn tuma mɛn na, a ka a fɔ ko: «Ko bɛɛ ra dafa.» A ka a kun najii ka a nii di ka sa.<verse eid="JHN 19:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 19:31"/>Ikomin Ɲɔɲɔ lon, su kana to jiri kan, a ni sali dakɔrɔla le tɛrɛ ye, baa Ɲɔɲɔ lon wo ye lon ba de ri, Yahudiyailu ka a fɔ Pilate yɛ ko a ye sɔn mɔɔ gbɔngbɔnnilu senilu ye rakadi, kosa ii ri faa jona. Wo rɔ ii ri se lajiila ka bɔ jiri kan. <verse eid="JHN 19:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JHN 19:32"/>Kɛlɛdenlu wara ii sen dakadi kanma. Mɔɔ fila mɛnilu gbɔngbɔnni Isa dafɛ, kɛlɛdenlu ka woilu fɔlɔman sen dakadi, ka ban ka a filana sen dakadi. <verse eid="JHN 19:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JHN 19:33"/>Ii se mɛn kɛni Isa ma, ii ka a yen a ra sa, wo rɔ ii ma a sen kadi. <verse eid="JHN 19:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JHN 19:34"/>Kɔni kɛlɛden kelen tɛrɛ ye ye mɛn ka a sɔɔ tanba la a barasa rɔ. Wo ɲa ma ji ni jeli bɔra i kɔrɔkɔrɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JHN 19:35"/>Mɛn ka a yen wo kɛra a la sereya ri. A la sereya ye tuɲa le ri. Ale ka a lɔn ko a ye tuɲa le fɔla. A ka sereya mɛn bɔ sa ai fanan di lemɛniya Isa ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JHN 19:36"/>Wo bɛɛ kɛra le ri sa sɛbɛli kuma ri dafa ko: «A kolo si kana kadi.» <verse eid="JHN 19:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JHN 19:37"/>Wo fanan ko rɔ, sɛbɛli kuma do ko: «Ii ri mɔɔ ragbɛ mɛn ii ka sɔɔ.»<verse eid="JHN 19:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa su don ko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JHN 19:38"/>Wo ban kɔ, Yusufu Arimateka, wara Pilate madiya ko a ni Isa su bɔ jiri kan. Pilate sɔnda wo ma. A nara Isa su lajii. Awa, Yusufu Arimateka tɛrɛ ye Isa la karanden do le ri sutura rɔ, baa a tɛrɛ silanni Yahudiyailu ɲɔ rɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JHN 19:39"/>A ni Nikodɛmu nara. Wo le fɔlɔfɔlɔ ka Isa ɲinin su rɔ. A nara latikɔlɔn sumaduman kilo bisawa, su fila ri: Do tɔɔ ko muri, a to kelen tɔɔ ko alo. <verse eid="JHN 19:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JHN 19:40"/>Ii fila ka Isa su ta, ka a don kasanke rɔ a ni latikɔlɔn sumaduman ka bɛn Yahudiyailu la su don ɲa namun ma. <verse eid="JHN 19:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JHN 19:41"/>Awa a gbɔngbɔnda jiri kan yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ jiritu do tɛrɛ ye ye. Jiritu wo rɔ ye, kaburu kura do tɛrɛ ye, mɔɔ si su tɛrɛ ma don wo rɔ fɔlɔ. <verse eid="JHN 19:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JHN 19:42"/>Yahudiyailu ɲɔɲɔ lon dabɛn waati tɛrɛ ra se. Kaburu tɛrɛ madonni ii la fanan. Wo rɔ ii ka Isa su don ye.<verse eid="JHN 19:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JHN 20"/>
  <para style="s">Isa wulira ka bɔ saya rɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 20:1"/>Lookun tele fɔlɔ, Lahadi lon kɔnin, Mariyamu Makidalaka wara su ba dibi pulan pulan ma kaburu da la. A ka a yen kabakurun bɔni kaburu da la. <verse eid="JHN 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 20:2"/>A ka ibori ka wa Simɔn Piyɛri tɛrɛn a ni karanden do mɛn diyara Isa yɛ, ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ii ra Maari su bɔ kaburu kɔndɔ. An ma a lɔn fewu, ii na a lala yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 20:3"/>Piyɛri ni karanden wo bɔra ka wa kaburu da la. <verse eid="JHN 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 20:4"/>Ii fila bɛɛ borimantɔ wara i ɲɔɔn fɛ. Kɔni karanden wo tɛrɛ ye borila Piyɛri ko: a fɔlɔ sera kaburu da la. <verse eid="JHN 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 20:5"/>A ka a mabirin ka a ɲa mala kaburu kɔndɔ ka kasanke le dɔrɔn yen, kɔni a ma don. <verse eid="JHN 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 20:6"/>Simɔn Piyɛri, mɛn tɛrɛ ye a kɔfɛ, wo fanan nara. A donda kaburu kɔndɔ, ka kasanke yen lani ye. <verse eid="JHN 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 20:7"/>Bitiran mɛn tɛrɛ ye Isa kun na wo ni kasanke tɛrɛ sa yɔrɔ kelen, kɔni bitiran tɛrɛ ra kunbɛnni ka a la a ta fan ma. <verse eid="JHN 20:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 20:8"/>Awa, karanden mɛn fɔlɔ sera kaburu da la, wo fanan donda kaburu kɔndɔ. A ka a yen ka la a la ko Isa ra wuli. <verse eid="JHN 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 20:9"/>Baa ii tɛrɛ ma sɛbɛli kuma wo ɲayen fɔlɔ, ikomin a tɛrɛ ye sɛbɛni ɲa mɛn dɔ ko Isa ri wuli ka bɔ suilu tɛma.<verse eid="JHN 20:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Mariyamu Makidalaka la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 20:10"/>Wo kɔrɔ, karanden fila ka i kɔsɛ ii wara. <verse eid="JHN 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 20:11"/>Waati wo rɔ Mariyamu tɛrɛ ye kasila ko ma kaburu da la. A ye kasila ka a ɲa mala kaburu kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 20:12"/>A ka mɛlɛka fila yen a bɛɛ gbɛni, woilu siini tɛrɛ Isa su tɛrɛ ye lani dinkira mɛn dɔ kaburu kɔndɔ. Do siini a kun kɔrɔ, do siini a sen kɔrɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 20:13"/>Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Muso, i kasila nfenna?» A ka a jabi: «Ka a masɔrɔn ii ra Maari su ta ka wa a ri, n ma a lɔn a ye yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ.» <verse eid="JHN 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 20:14"/>A banni wo fɔla, a tintan ɲa mɛn dɔ ka Isa yen, kɔni a tɛrɛ ma a lɔn ni Isa le. <verse eid="JHN 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 20:15"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Muso, i kasila nfenna? I ye yon ɲininna?» Ikomin a tɛrɛ ye muso ɲana ikɔ jiritu tii la, a ka a fɔ ko: «N fa, ni ile le ka a su ta ka wa a ri, a fɔ n yɛ i ka a la yɔrɔ mɛn dɔ, n ye wa a ta.» <verse eid="JHN 20:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 20:16"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Mariyamu!» A ka a ɲa tintan a la, ka a tuwa Heburu kan dɔ ko: «Rabuni» Wo kɔrɔ ye ko Karanmɔɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 20:17"/>Isa ka a jabi: «I kana ifasa n na, baa n ma yɛlɛ fɔlɔ n Fa ma. Kɔni wa i fɔ n badenmailu yɛ ko: ‹N watɔ n Fa ma, a ni ai Fa fanan ma, n na Alla ma, a ni ai fanan na Alla ma.›» <verse eid="JHN 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 20:18"/>Mariyamu Makidalaka nara a fɔ karandenilu yɛ ko: «N da Maari yen!» A ka dantɛɛli kɛ ii yɛ a ka mɛn fɔ a yɛ.<verse eid="JHN 20:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka karandenilu la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 20:19"/>Lookun lon fɔlɔman kelen wo wura la, karandenilu tɛrɛ ye bon do kɔndɔ, da sɔɔni ii ma ka a masɔrɔn ii silanni Yahudiyailu ɲɛmɔɔilu ɲɔ rɔ. Isa bɔra gbɛ rɔ ka na i lɔ ii tɛma ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Alla ye ai jususuma!» <verse eid="JHN 20:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 20:20"/>A ka a fɔ waati mɛn dɔ, a ka a bolo yiraka ii la a ni a barasa. Karandenilu sawa ba kɛra ka a masɔrɔn ii ra Maari yen. <verse eid="JHN 20:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 20:21"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ fanan ko: «Alla ye jususuma di ii ma! Ikomin n Fa le ka n kelaya, nde fanan di aile kelaya.» <verse eid="JHN 20:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 20:22"/>A banni kuma wo fɔla a ka fɔɲɔ fɛ ai ma ka a fɔ ko: «Ai ye Nii Sɛniman sɔrɔn. <verse eid="JHN 20:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 20:23"/>Ni ai ka mɔɔ makoto a la julumun ma, wo tii makotoni Alla bolo. Kɔni ni ai ma mɛn makoto, wo tii tɛ makotoni Alla bolo.»<verse eid="JHN 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka Tomasi la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 20:24"/>Nba, Tomasi ye Isa la karanden tan ni fila do le ri, mɔɔilu ye a fɔla mɛn ma ko Filani. Isa nara a lɔ a la karandenilu tɛma tuma mɛn na, Tomasi tun tɛ ye. <verse eid="JHN 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 20:25"/>Karandenilu ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An da Maari yen!» Kɔni a ka ii jabi: «Ni n ma poyinti nɔ yen a bolo rɔ, ni n ma n bolokoyini la poyinti nɔ rɔ, ni n ma n bolo la a barasa kɔndɔ, n tɛ lala a la fewu.»<verse eid="JHN 20:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JHN 20:26"/>Lookun kelen tamin kɔ rɔ, karandenilu ka ii ladɛn kokura bon na. Ii la ladɛn wo rɔ, Tomasi tɛrɛ ye ii tɛma. Ii tɛrɛ ra da sɔɔ. Isa nara ka i lɔ ii tɛma ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Alla ye jususuma di ii ma!» <verse eid="JHN 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JHN 20:27"/>A ka a fɔ Tomasi yɛ ko: «I bolokoyini ladon n bolo ma, i ye n bolo yen; i bolo ladon n barasa kɔndɔ. I kana to lemɛniyabaliya rɔ, kɔni lemɛniya.» <verse eid="JHN 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JHN 20:28"/>Tomasi ka a jabi: «N Maari, a ni n Alla!» <verse eid="JHN 20:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JHN 20:29"/>Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Ka a masɔrɔn i ra n yen, wo le ka i lemɛniya n ma. Duwawu ye ii yɛ mɛnilu ma n yen a ni mɛnilu lemɛniyara n ma.»<verse eid="JHN 20:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JHN 20:30"/>Isa ka kabannako siyaman kɛ a la karandenilu ɲakɔrɔ mɛn sɛbɛni tɛ kitabu ɲin kɔndɔ. <verse eid="JHN 20:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JHN 20:31"/>Kɔni, ɲin bɛɛ tɛrɛ sɛbɛni de sani ai ye lemɛniya Isa la waati mɛn ko Ɲenematɔmɔnin de, a ni ale le ye Alla Dencɛ de. Ai wa lemɛniya a ma, ai ri ɲenemaya banbali sɔrɔn ale tɔɔ rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 20:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JHN 21"/>
  <para style="s">Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka a la karandenilu la dala da la</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JHN 21:1"/>Waati wo tamin kɔ rɔ, Isa ka a jɛrɛ yiraka a la karandenilu la Tibɛriyasi Dala da la. A ka a jɛrɛ yiraka wo ɲa le ma. <verse eid="JHN 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JHN 21:2"/>Simɔn Piyɛri, Tomasi mɛn ye kilila ko Filani, a ni Natanayɛli mɛn bɔni Kana mɛn ye Kalile mara rɔ, wo ni Sebede dencɛ fila, a ni karanden fila do, wo bɛɛ tɛrɛ ye i ɲɔɔn fɛ. <verse eid="JHN 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JHN 21:3"/>Simɔn Piyɛri ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N watɔ jɛɛ faa diya.» Ii ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «An fanan di wa i kɔfɛ.» Ii bɔra ka yɛlɛ kulun kɔndɔ. Su kelen wo rɔ, ii ma foyi mira. <verse eid="JHN 21:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JHN 21:4"/>Wo sɔɔma da la, Isa tɛrɛ ye dala da la, kɔni a la karandenilu ma a lɔn ko ni Isa le ye. <verse eid="JHN 21:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JHN 21:5"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «N denilu, ai ra jɛɛ do sɔrɔn wa?» Ii ka a jabi: «Ɛɛn.» <verse eid="JHN 21:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JHN 21:6"/>A ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye jɔɔ lafili kulun bolokininma fan fɛ, ai ri jɛɛ mira.» Ii ka jɔɔ lafili wo rɔ, ii tɛrɛ ti se a masɔmɔnna jɛɛ siyaman bolo. <verse eid="JHN 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JHN 21:7"/>Wo rɔ karanden mɛn duman tɛrɛ Isa yɛ, wo le ka a fɔ Piyɛri yɛ ko: «Maari le!» Wo ka a tɛrɛn duruki gbansan ye Simɔn Piyɛri kan na. Awa, a ka a mɛn tuma mɛn na ko Maari le, a ka duruki wo tɛsidi, ka i juran ji rɔ ka wa Isa tɛrɛn ye. <verse eid="JHN 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JHN 21:8"/>Karanden doilu ni kulun nara a ni jɛɛ siyaman ba a ni jɔɔ, baa a tɛrɛ ma jan bakɛ dala da la, ko a ri mɛtɛri kɛmɛ ɲɔɔn bɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JHN 21:9"/>Ii se mɛn kɛni gbelema ii ka jɛɛ do yen janinna sinkɔn ta la, a ni buru. <verse eid="JHN 21:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JHN 21:10"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye ai la jɛɛ do ta, a nani mɛn di.» <verse eid="JHN 21:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JHN 21:11"/>Simɔn Piyɛri yɛlɛra kulun kɔndɔ ka jɔɔ sɔmɔn ka jɛɛ kunba kɛmɛ a ni biloolu ni sawa mira. Hali jɛɛ wa siyaya bakɛ jɔɔ ti a rafarafarala. <verse eid="JHN 21:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JHN 21:12"/>Isa ka a fɔ ii yɛ ko: «Ai ye na dabɔ kɛ.» Karanden woilu si ma susu ka a maɲininka ko: «Yon de i ri?» Ii ka a lɔn ko Maari le. <verse eid="JHN 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JHN 21:13"/>Isa ka buru ta ka a ratala ii la, ka jɛɛ fanan datala ii la. <verse eid="JHN 21:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JHN 21:14"/>Isa wuli ka bɔ saya rɔ, a yiraka sawanan de tɛrɛ ye a la karandenilu la.<verse eid="JHN 21:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isa ka Piyɛri fɛsɛfɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JHN 21:15"/>Ii banni dabɔla, Isa ka a fɔ Simɔn Piyɛri yɛ ko: «Yuhana dencɛ Simɔn, n duman i yɛ ka tamin do ɲin bɛɛ la wa?» A ka a jabi: «Ɔɔn Maari, i ka a lɔn ko i duman n yɛ.» Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye n na saa denninilu balo.» <verse eid="JHN 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JHN 21:16"/>A ka a fɔ a yɛ fanan ko: «Yuhana dencɛ Simɔn, n duman i yɛ wa?» Piyɛri ka a jabi: «Ɔɔn Maari, i ka a lɔn ko i duman n yɛ.» Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye kɛ n na saa kɔnɔgbɛnna le ri.» <verse eid="JHN 21:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JHN 21:17"/>A ka a fɔ a yɛ a siɲa sawanan dɔ ko: «Yuhana dencɛ Simɔn, n duman i yɛ wa?» Piyɛri niiafinda, baa Isa ra a maɲininka fo siɲa sawa ko: «N duman i yɛ wa?» A ka a jabi: «Maari, i ka ko bɛɛ lɔn. I ka a lɔn ko i duman n yɛ.» Isa ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «I ye n na saa denninilu balo. <verse eid="JHN 21:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JHN 21:18"/>N ye tuɲa le fɔla i yɛ ko: i tɛrɛ ye denninya rɔ waati mɛn dɔ i tɛrɛ ye i la kurusi yala sidila ka wa yɔrɔ rɔ, yɔrɔ mɛn ta duman i yɛ, kɔni i wa kɔrɔya tuma mɛn na, i ri i bolo rasɔmɔn, mɔɔ gbɛrɛ ri i sidi ka i lawa yɔrɔ rɔ, yɔrɔ mɛn i tɛ a fɛ ka wa.» <verse eid="JHN 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JHN 21:19"/>Isa ka kuma wo fɔ ka Piyɛri sa ɲa yiraka, a ri mɛn kɛ sa a ri Alla tɔɔ gbiliya. Wo rɔ a ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Bila n kɔfɛ.»<verse eid="JHN 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Karanden mɛn duman tɛrɛ Isa yɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JHN 21:20"/>Piyɛri ka kɔfɛnɛ, ka Isa la karanden yen mɛn duman a yɛ, a ye taamala ii kɔfɛ. A la karanden mɛn tɛrɛ ye a kɔfɛ dɔɔnnin waati la, mɛn ka a kun la a sisi rɔ ka a fɔ a yɛ ko: «Yon ye i janfala?» <verse eid="JHN 21:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JHN 21:21"/>Piyɛri ka a yen ka a fɔ Isa yɛ ko: «Ɲin don? A ko di?» <verse eid="JHN 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JHN 21:22"/>Isa ka a jabi: «Ni a duman n yɛ a ye to dunuɲa rɔ haan n ye na waati mɛn dɔ, wo tɔnɔ ɲuman ɲa la i ma? Ile, bila n kɔ!» <verse eid="JHN 21:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JHN 21:23"/>Kuma wo kosɔn, a tɛrɛ ye fɔla fan bɛɛ badenmailu tɛma ko karanden wo ti faala. Kɔni Isa ma a fɔ ko ale ti faala, kɔni ko: «Ni a duman n yɛ a ye to dunuɲa rɔ haan n ye na waati mɛn dɔ, wo tɔnɔ ɲuman ɲa la i ma?»<verse eid="JHN 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JHN 21:24"/>Karanden kelen wo le kɛla a la sereya ri a la ko bɛɛ rɔ a ni a ka ko bɛɛ sɛbɛ. An ka a lɔn ko a la sereya ye tuɲa le ri. <verse eid="JHN 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JHN 21:25"/>Isa ka ko gbɛrɛ siyaman kɛ, mɛnilu ma sɛbɛ yan. Ni wo kelen kelenna bɛɛ tun sɛbɛra, kitabu mɛnilu tun di sɛbɛ wo rɔ, woilu tun tɛ kun dunuɲa rɔ.<verse eid="JHN 21:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JHN 21"/>
</usx>
